HELP_TEXT["sw"] = [["View the HUD and current objective at any time by pressing", "Tazama HUD na lengo la sasa wakati wowote kwa kubonyeza [DPAD-DOWN]", ["DPAD-DOWN"]], ["The HUD will display other important info, like health stamina focus and more.", "HUD itaonyesha taarifa nyingine muhimu, kama afya [ICON1] stamina [ICON2] umakini [ICON3] na zaidi.", ["ICON", "ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: The HUD will show relevant information in the moment, like your money before making a purchase. You can adjust what appears on the HUD in the Settings menu.", "Kidokezo: HUD itaonyesha taarifa muhimu kwa wakati husika, kama pesa zako kabla ya kufanya ununuzi. Unaweza kurekebisha kinachoonekana kwenye HUD katika menyu ya Mipangilio.", []], ["Press to open the map, then press to set a destination", "Bonyeza [TOUCHPAD] kufungua ramani, kisha bonyeza [X] kuweka kifikio [ICON1]", ["TOUCHPAD", "X", "ICON"]], ["You can also set a destination while using quick navigation by holding and pressing on an in-world marker.", "Unaweza pia kuweka kifikio unapotumia uelekezaji wa haraka kwa kushikilia [DPAD-DOWN] na kubonyeza [R3] kwenye alama ya ulimwenguni.", ["DPAD-DOWN", "R3"]], ["Tip: You can only set one destination at a time, but can add multiple markers to the map to help remember useful locations.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kuweka kifikio kimoja tu kwa wakati mmoja, lakini unaweza kuongeza alama nyingi kwenye ramani ili kukumbuka maeneo muhimu.", []], ["Press to open the map, then press to view the index.", "Bonyeza [TOUCHPAD] kufungua ramani, kisha bonyeza [DPAD-RIGHT] kutazama faharasa.", ["TOUCHPAD", "DPAD-RIGHT"]], ["The index shows all the tasks and locations you've discovered. Explore the different sections and hover over a task or location to learn more about it.", "Faharasa inaonyesha kazi na maeneo yote uliyogundua. Chunguza sehemu mbalimbali na weka kiteuzi juu ya kazi au eneo ili kujua zaidi kulihusu.", []], ["Check the map regularly for new opportunities. Anything new will be marked on the index", "Angalia ramani mara kwa mara kwa fursa mpya. Chochote kipya kitawekewa alama kwenye faharasa [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Hold to view tasks or locations nearby on the HUD.", "Kidokezo: Shikilia [DPAD-DOWN] kutazama kazi au maeneo yaliyo karibu kwenye HUD.", ["DPAD-DOWN"]], ["Press to use your phone.", "Bonyeza [DPAD-UP] kutumia simu yako.", ["DPAD-UP"]], ["Keep track of any important notifications or calls you may have missed by checking your Reminders", "Fuatilia arifa au simu muhimu ambazo huenda umezikosa kwa kuangalia Vikumbusho vyako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Stay in touch with people via the Contacts app and on WhatUp.", "Wasiliana na watu kupitia programu ya Wawasiliani na kwenye WhatUp.", []], ["Keep an eye on the News app and Snapmatic for the latest around Leonida.", "Fuatilia programu ya Habari na Snapmatic kwa matukio ya karibuni kote Leonida.", []], ["Tip: Each app offers specific features worth checking out, and more will unlock as you progress.", "Kidokezo: Kila programu ina vipengele maalum vinavyostahili kuangaliwa, na zaidi vitafunguka unapoendelea.", []], ["Pay attention to your surroundings and look out for anything unusual. Investigating strange noises, confrontations, and accidents may lead to new opportunities.", "Kuwa makini na mazingira yako na tafuta chochote kisicho cha kawaida. Kuchunguza kelele za ajabu, mizozo na ajali kunaweza kuleta fursa mpya.", []], ["To interact with anyone, hold while looking at them. While in a vehicle, hold to interact with people.", "Ili kuwasiliana na mtu yeyote, shikilia [L2] ukimtazama. Ukiwa ndani ya gari, shikilia [DPAD-UP] kuwasiliana na watu.", ["L2", "DPAD-UP"]], ["You can also focus to slow time, highlight nearby items, and to pick up on the direction of unusual noises.", "Unaweza pia kutumia umakini [L3] [R3] kupunguza kasi ya muda, kuangazia vitu vilivyo karibu na kutambua mwelekeo wa kelele zisizo za kawaida.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Tip: Hold and press to more closely inspect your surroundings.", "Kidokezo: Shikilia [L2] na ubonyeze [R3] kukagua mazingira yako kwa karibu zaidi.", ["L2", "R3"]], ["Your health bar is shown in the top left of the HUD. You'll lose health if you take damage, but your health bar will partially recover over time.", "Upau wako wa afya unaonyeshwa juu kushoto kwenye HUD. Utapoteza afya ukiumizwa, lakini upau wako wa afya utarejea kwa sehemu kadiri muda unavyopita.", []], ["Recover it fully by taking Zombix, consuming certain food and drinks, and sleeping at your safehouse Zombix is available to buy at local grocery stores but can also be found around Leonida.", "Irejeshe kikamilifu kwa kutumia Zombix, kula vyakula na vinywaji fulani, na kulala kwenye nyumba yako salama [ICON1] Zombix inapatikana kununuliwa kwenye maduka ya vyakula ya karibu [ICON2] lakini pia inaweza kupatikana kote Leonida.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: Keep some extra Zombix in your loadout in case you ever need it.", "Kidokezo: Weka Zombix ya ziada kwenye mzigo wako endapo utaihitaji.", []], ["Consumables like food and drinks can restore and temporarily extend your health bar", "Vitu vya kutumia kama vyakula na vinywaji vinaweza kurejesha na kurefusha kwa muda upau wako wa afya [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["When buffed, your health capacity will increase and regenerate fully until you get wasted or start a new session.", "Ukiongezewa nguvu, uwezo wako wa afya utaongezeka na kujirejesha kikamilifu hadi utakapouawa au kuanza kipindi kipya.", []], ["Tip: Take adrenaline to significantly overpower all of your stats for a short time, filling your health and reducing damage taken.", "Kidokezo: Tumia adrenalini [ICON1] kuongeza sana takwimu zako zote kwa muda mfupi, ukijaza afya yako na kupunguza uharibifu unaopata.", ["ICON"]], ["Strength workouts can permanently extend your health bar while building muscle.", "Mazoezi ya nguvu yanaweza kurefusha kabisa upau wako wa afya [ICON1] huku yakijenga misuli.", ["ICON"]], ["The best place to do strength exercises is in a gym via bench presses, chest flys, deadlifts, and more.", "Mahali bora pa kufanya mazoezi ya nguvu ni gym [ICON1] kupitia kunyanyua uzito ukiwa umelala, mazoezi ya kifua, kunyanyua uzito kutoka sakafuni na mengineyo.", ["ICON"]], ["Use the Fitness app to track your workouts, body shape, and overall progression. If you miss your workout window enough times, you'll risk going down a level.", "Tumia programu ya Siha [ICON1] kufuatilia mazoezi yako, umbo la mwili na maendeleo kwa jumla. Ukikosa muda wako wa mazoezi mara nyingi vya kutosha, utakuwa hatarini kushuka kiwango.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Make sure you're well-rested before a workout. If you're tired, it will impact your stamina recovery.", "Kidokezo: Hakikisha umepumzika vizuri kabla ya mazoezi. Ukiwa umechoka, itaathiri urejeshaji wa stamina yako.", []], ["Body armor is sold at Ammu-Nations While equipped, your health is protected from gunshots or explosive damage until it fully breaks.", "Kinga ya mwili inauzwa kwenye maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] Ukiivaa, afya yako inalindwa dhidi ya risasi au uharibifu wa milipuko hadi ivunjike kabisa.", ["ICON"]], ["To manage body armor on the move, hold and press to access it. Select the armor and press to equip or unequip it.", "Ili kudhibiti kinga ya mwili ukiwa safarini, shikilia [L1] na ubonyeze [R1] kuifikia. Chagua kinga na ubonyeze [X] kuivaa au kuivua.", ["L1", "R1", "X"]], ["Tip: You can store extra body armor in your trunk when purchasing it at Ammu-Nations.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kuhifadhi kinga ya mwili ya ziada kwenye buti la gari lako [ICON1] unapoinunua kwenye Ammu-Nation.", ["ICON"]], ["Your stamina bar is shown in the top left of the HUD. Stamina drains when you sprint or exert yourself. It will recover fully when you take a break.", "Upau wako wa stamina unaonyeshwa juu kushoto kwenye HUD. Stamina hupungua unapokimbia kasi au kujitutumua. Itarejea kikamilifu unapopumzika.", []], ["Recover stamina faster or temporarily extend it by consuming certain food and drinks, like protein bars and sodas. Sleeping at your safehouse will also buff your stamina capacity.", "Rejesha stamina haraka zaidi au irefushe kwa muda kwa kula vyakula na vinywaji fulani, kama baa za protini na soda. Kulala kwenye nyumba yako salama [ICON1] pia kutaongeza uwezo wako wa stamina.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Manage your stamina. If it's fully drained, you'll be too tired to perform some actions for a short time.", "Kidokezo: Dhibiti stamina yako. Ikiisha kabisa, utakuwa umechoka mno kufanya baadhi ya vitendo kwa muda mfupi.", []], ["Consumables like food and drinks can restore and temporarily extend your stamina bar", "Vitu vya kutumia kama vyakula na vinywaji vinaweza kurejesha na kurefusha kwa muda upau wako wa stamina [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["When buffed, your stamina capacity will increase until you get wasted or start a new session.", "Ukiongezewa nguvu, uwezo wako wa stamina utaongezeka hadi utakapouawa au kuanza kipindi kipya.", []], ["Tip: Take adrenaline to significantly overpower your stats, filling your stamina and reducing the rate it drains.", "Kidokezo: Tumia adrenalini [ICON1] kuongeza sana takwimu zako, ukijaza stamina yako na kupunguza kasi inavyopungua.", ["ICON"]], ["Cardio workouts can permanently extend your stamina bar and burn calories to help with weight loss.", "Mazoezi ya kadio yanaweza kurefusha kabisa upau wako wa stamina [ICON1] na kuchoma kalori kusaidia kupunguza uzito.", ["ICON"]], ["The best place to do cardio exercises is in a gym via running, cycling, and using the punching bag.", "Mahali bora pa kufanya mazoezi ya kadio ni gym [ICON1] kupitia kukimbia, kuendesha baiskeli na kutumia mfuko wa ngumi.", ["ICON"]], ["Your focus bar drains when you use combat focus. It will recover fully over time.", "Upau wako wa umakini hupungua unapotumia umakini vitani. Utarejea kikamilifu kadiri muda unavyopita.", []], ["Recover focus faster or extend it by consuming certain drinks, like coffee or tea.", "Rejesha umakini haraka zaidi au uurefushe kwa kunywa vinywaji fulani, kama kahawa au chai.", []], ["Tip: Using focus out of combat, like when searching your surroundings, won't drain your focus bar.", "Kidokezo: Kutumia umakini nje ya mapambano, kama unapochunguza mazingira yako, hakutapunguza upau wako wa umakini.", []], ["Consumables like food and drinks can restore and temporarily extend your focus bar", "Vitu vya kutumia kama vyakula na vinywaji vinaweza kurejesha na kurefusha kwa muda upau wako wa umakini [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["When buffed, your focus bar will remain extended until you get wasted or start a new session.", "Ukiongezewa nguvu, upau wako wa umakini utabaki umerefushwa hadi utakapouawa au kuanza kipindi kipya.", []], ["Tip: Take adrenaline to significantly overpower your stats, filling your focus and reducing the rate it drains.", "Kidokezo: Tumia adrenalini [ICON1] kuongeza sana takwimu zako, ukijaza umakini wako na kupunguza kasi unavyopungua.", ["ICON"]], ["Permanently extend your focus bar with activities that require concentration or mindfulness. These include:", "Refusha kabisa upau wako wa umakini [ICON1] kwa shughuli zinazohitaji kuzingatia au utulivu wa akili. Hizi ni pamoja na:", ["ICON"]], ["Shooting ranges", "[ICON1] Viwanja vya kulenga shabaha", ["ICON"]], ["Golf putting", "[ICON1] Kupiga putt kwenye gofu", ["ICON"]], ["Pool", "[ICON1] Pool", ["ICON"]], ["Catching fish", "[ICON1] Kuvua samaki", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Depending on your current criminal profile, incapacitations or headshots against enemies can increase your focus.", "Kidokezo: Kulingana na wasifu wako wa kihalifu wa sasa, kuwalemaza maadui au kuwapiga risasi kichwani kunaweza kuongeza umakini wako.", []], ["Jason or Lucia's body shape will change depending on their fitness levels and calorie intake.", "Umbo la mwili wa Jason au Lucia litabadilika kulingana na viwango vyao vya siha na kalori wanazokula.", []], ["Cardio and a balanced diet will lead to a leaner physique, while strength exercises will lead to an increase in muscle mass.", "Kadio na lishe bora vitaleta mwili mwembamba zaidi, huku mazoezi ya nguvu yakiongeza misuli.", []], ["Consuming a surplus of calories without working out will increase weight and reduce definition.", "Kula kalori za ziada bila kufanya mazoezi kutaongeza uzito na kupunguza umbo la misuli.", []], ["Tip: Check the Fitness app to keep track of your calorie intake and body shape.", "Kidokezo: Angalia programu ya Siha [ICON1] kufuatilia kalori unazokula na umbo la mwili wako.", ["ICON"]], ["Sleep at your safehouse to move time forward.", "Lala kwenye nyumba yako salama [ICON1] kusogeza muda mbele.", ["ICON"]], ["Sleeping also restores your health and focus, and temporarily buffs your stamina.", "Kulala pia hurejesha afya na umakini wako, na kuongeza stamina yako kwa muda.", []], ["Tip: Make sure to get some sleep before and after a workout. It will help with stamina performance and general recovery.", "Kidokezo: Hakikisha unalala kabla na baada ya mazoezi. Itasaidia utendaji wa stamina na kupona kwa jumla.", []], ["Use the shower or sink at your safehouse to restore and temporarily buff your focus.", "Tumia bafu au sinki kwenye nyumba yako salama [ICON1] kurejesha na kuongeza umakini wako kwa muda.", ["ICON"]], ["You can also freshen up in restrooms or stores around Leonida.", "Unaweza pia kujiburudisha kwenye vyoo au maduka kote Leonida.", []], ["Tip: Having bloodstains on you may raise suspicion from the cops. You can shower to clean yourself up.", "Kidokezo: Kuwa na madoa ya damu mwilini kunaweza kuwatia polisi shaka. Unaweza kuoga ili kujisafisha.", []], ["Continue Jason and Lucia's story to learn more.", "Endelea na hadithi ya Jason na Lucia ili kujua zaidi.", []], ["While unarmed or equipped with a melee weapon, press to attack, or hold for a heavy attack.", "Ukiwa bila silaha au na silaha ya mapigano ya karibu, bonyeza [SQUARE] kushambulia, au shikilia [SQUARE] kwa shambulio zito.", ["SQUARE", "SQUARE"]], ["Hold to grapple your opponent. While grappling, press to perform a follow-up attack. Hold to put your opponent in a vulnerable position.", "Shikilia [R2] kumkamata mpinzani wako. Ukiwa umemkamata, bonyeza [SQUARE] kufanya shambulio la kufuatia. Shikilia [SQUARE] kumweka mpinzani wako katika hali dhaifu.", ["R2", "SQUARE", "SQUARE"]], ["Tip: Melee attacks drain your stamina bar If it's completely drained, your attacks will be less effective until you recover.", "Kidokezo: Mashambulizi ya karibu hupunguza upau wako wa stamina [ICON1] Ukiisha kabisa, mashambulizi yako yatakuwa dhaifu hadi utakapopona.", ["ICON"]], ["Hold to block melee attacks.", "Shikilia [X] kuzuia mashambulizi ya karibu.", ["X"]], ["Press before an incoming attack to counter, then follow up with to attack during an opening.", "Bonyeza [X] kabla ya shambulio linalokuja ili kujibu, kisha fuatia na [SQUARE] kushambulia mpinzani anapokuwa wazi.", ["X", "SQUARE"]], ["Tip: Countering requires precise timing. Watch your opponent's movements closely.", "Kidokezo: Kujibu shambulio kunahitaji muda sahihi. Tazama mienendo ya mpinzani wako kwa makini.", []], ["Press while aiming to swap to another weapon without opening your loadout.", "Bonyeza [TRIANGLE] unapolenga kubadili kwenda silaha nyingine bila kufungua mzigo wako.", ["TRIANGLE"]], ["Tip: If you run out of ammo, swapping weapons can be faster than reloading.", "Kidokezo: Risasi zikikuishia, kubadili silaha kunaweza kuwa haraka kuliko kujaza upya.", []], ["While aiming a firearm, press to zoom in for greater accuracy.", "Unapolenga bunduki, bonyeza [R3] kukuza kwa usahihi zaidi.", ["R3"]], ["Sustained fire may reduce your accuracy, so firing in shorter bursts can help keep your shots on target.", "Kufyatua mfululizo kunaweza kupunguza usahihi wako, hivyo kufyatua kwa mfululizo mfupi kunaweza kusaidia risasi zako kugonga lengo.", []], ["Tip: You can shoot from the hip without aiming, and sacrifice accuracy for mobility.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kufyatua bila kulenga, ukipoteza usahihi ili kupata wepesi wa kusonga.", []], ["While aiming a firearm, press to swap your view from one shoulder to the other.", "Unapolenga bunduki, bonyeza [DPAD-LEFT] kubadili mtazamo wako kutoka bega moja hadi jingine.", ["DPAD-LEFT"]], ["Tip: Swapping shoulders can give you a better angle for easier aiming in some situations.", "Kidokezo: Kubadili mabega kunaweza kukupa pembe bora ya kulenga kwa urahisi katika hali fulani.", []], ["Hold to aim a grenade and other explosives.", "Shikilia [L2] kulenga guruneti na vilipuzi vingine.", ["L2"]], ["Press to throw a grenade, or hold to pull the pin and prime it before throwing.", "Bonyeza [R2] kurusha guruneti, au shikilia [R2] kuvuta pini na kuliandaa kabla ya kurusha.", ["R2", "R2"]], ["Tip: While aiming a firearm, you can hold to quickly throw your last equipped explosive.", "Kidokezo: Unapolenga bunduki, unaweza kushikilia [R1] kurusha haraka kilipuzi chako cha mwisho ulichoshika.", ["R1"]], ["Press to crouch. While crouched, you'll be harder to detect and moving slowly will reduce the amount of noise you make.", "Bonyeza [CIRCLE] kuinama. Ukiwa umeinama, itakuwa vigumu zaidi kukugundua na kusonga taratibu kutapunguza kelele unazopiga.", ["CIRCLE"]], ["Hold when you sneak up behind an enemy to grab them, then repeatedly press to perform a stealth takedown.", "Shikilia [R2] unapomnyemelea adui kwa nyuma ili kumkamata, kisha bonyeza [SQUARE] mara kwa mara kumwangusha kimyakimya.", ["R2", "SQUARE"]], ["Tip: If you notice an enemy is starting to detect your location, find cover quick and get out of their line of sight.", "Kidokezo: Ukiona adui anaanza kugundua mahali ulipo, tafuta kizuizi haraka na utoke kwenye mstari wake wa kuona.", []], ["While hidden, misdirect enemies to prevent detection. You can pick up objects like glass bottles, then press or hold to throw them and draw enemies away from you.", "Ukiwa umejificha, wapotoshe maadui ili wasikugundue. Unaweza kuokota vitu kama chupa za kioo, kisha bonyeza au shikilia [R2] kuvirusha na kuwavuta maadui mbali nawe.", ["R2"]], ["Hold while looking at an enemy and whistle to lure them towards you. This can help you isolate individual enemies, making them easier to take out.", "Shikilia [L2] ukimtazama adui na upige mluzi kumvutia kwako. Hii inaweza kukusaidia kuwatenga maadui mmoja mmoja, na kuwafanya rahisi kuwaangamiza.", ["L2"]], ["Tip: Focus to keep a close eye on enemies nearby and check your surroundings for any objects to draw them away.", "Kidokezo: Tumia umakini [L3] [R3] kuwafuatilia kwa karibu maadui walio karibu na kutafuta katika mazingira yako vitu vya kuwavuta mbali.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Taking cover makes you harder to hit. Press to find cover and duck behind the nearest obstacle.", "Kujificha nyuma ya kizuizi kunakufanya kuwa vigumu kupigwa. Bonyeza [R1] kutafuta kizuizi na kujificha nyuma ya kikwazo kilicho karibu zaidi.", ["R1"]], ["While in cover, use to look around. Peer around a corner then press to move around it without breaking cover.", "Ukiwa nyuma ya kizuizi, tumia [LEFT-STICK] kutazama pande zote. Chungulia kwenye kona kisha bonyeza [X] kuizunguka bila kuacha kizuizi.", ["LEFT-STICK", "X"]], ["Press again to leave cover.", "Bonyeza [R1] tena kuacha kizuizi.", ["R1"]], ["Tip: You can press while behind cover to fire your gun, then quickly duck back.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kubonyeza [R2] ukiwa nyuma ya kizuizi kufyatua bunduki yako, kisha ujifiche tena haraka.", ["R2"]], ["Press immediately after climbing an obstacle to jump again. Chain your jumps together to keep momentum.", "Bonyeza [X] mara tu baada ya kupanda kikwazo ili kuruka tena. Unganisha miruko yako ili kudumisha kasi.", ["X"]], ["Tip: Chaining jumps allows faster traversal, especially when you're being pursued.", "Kidokezo: Kuunganisha miruko kunaruhusu kusafiri haraka zaidi, hasa unapofukuzwa.", []], ["While running towards a vehicle, press at the right moment to slide over the hood.", "Unapokimbia kuelekea gari, bonyeza [X] kwa wakati sahihi kuteleza juu ya boneti.", ["X"]], ["Tip: This can be useful while being pursued by the cops, and allows you to keep moving without losing momentum.", "Kidokezo: Hii inaweza kusaidia unapofukuzwa na polisi, na inakuwezesha kuendelea kusonga bila kupoteza kasi.", []], ["While in water, press or hold to swim faster. Hold to dive or to surface.", "Ukiwa majini, bonyeza au shikilia [L3] kuogelea kwa kasi. Shikilia [R1] kuzama au [X] kuibuka.", ["L3", "R1", "X"]], ["Tip: While underwater, hold to strafe in the water or swim backwards.", "Kidokezo: Ukiwa chini ya maji, shikilia [L2] kusogea kando majini au kuogelea kinyumenyume.", ["L2"]], ["Approach a body of water and press to dive in, or hold to perform a trick.", "Karibia eneo la maji na ubonyeze [X] kupiga mbizi, au shikilia [X] kufanya kitimbi.", ["X", "X"]], ["When in the water, hold to dive deeper or to surface.", "Ukiwa majini, shikilia [R1] kuzama zaidi au [X] kuibuka.", ["R1", "X"]], ["Use WAiNK to learn more about landmarks, sculptures, and curiosities you find. The app will notify you if something is nearby.", "Tumia WAiNK [ICON1] kujifunza zaidi kuhusu alama maarufu, sanamu na vitu vya kustaajabisha unavyopata. Programu itakuarifu kitu kikiwa karibu.", ["ICON"]], ["Hold then hold to scan these locations with WAiNK.", "Shikilia [DPAD-UP] kisha shikilia [R1] kuchanganua maeneo haya kwa WAiNK.", ["DPAD-UP", "R1"]], ["Tip: You can review information about WAiNK locations you've scanned in the Progress menu.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kupitia taarifa kuhusu maeneo ya WAiNK uliyochanganua katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["Sports cards and other collectible trading cards can be found around Leonida and sold at a pawn shop", "Kadi za michezo na kadi nyingine za mkusanyiko zinaweza kupatikana kote Leonida na kuuzwa kwenye duka la rehani [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Collectible cards will be kept in a box in your safehouse until you sell them. You can track entire collections in the Progress menu.", "Kadi za mkusanyiko zitahifadhiwa kwenye sanduku katika nyumba yako salama [ICON1] hadi utakapoziuza. Unaweza kufuatilia mikusanyiko yote katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Collectible cards will range in value based on their rarity and color variant.", "Kidokezo: Thamani ya kadi za mkusanyiko itatofautiana kulingana na upekee na aina ya rangi yake.", []], ["Race tracks, off-roading courses, and illegal street races can be found across Leonida, offering opportunities to compete to earn rewards.", "Viwanja vya mbio, njia za nje ya barabara na mbio haramu za mitaani vinapatikana kote Leonida, vikitoa fursa za kushindana ili kupata zawadi.", []], ["To race, you will need a vehicle with a high enough race rating suitable for the course.", "Ili kushiriki mbio, utahitaji gari lenye ukadiriaji wa mbio wa kutosha [ICON1] unaofaa njia hiyo.", ["ICON"]], ["If you don't have a ride, race organizers have vehicles for rent, for a small fee.", "Kama huna gari, waandaaji wa mbio wana magari ya kukodisha kwa ada ndogo.", []], ["Tip: Different mods can improve or change your vehicle's race rating, like wheel kits, tires, and engine upgrades.", "Kidokezo: Marekebisho mbalimbali yanaweza kuboresha au kubadilisha ukadiriaji wa mbio wa gari lako, kama vifaa vya magurudumu, matairi na maboresho ya injini.", []], ["Your vehicle will be allowed entry into an organized race only if it has a suitable race rating. Race ratings can be improved by upgrading your vehicle at a mod shop", "Gari lako litaruhusiwa kuingia kwenye mbio iliyoandaliwa tu ikiwa lina ukadiriaji wa mbio unaofaa. Ukadiriaji wa mbio unaweza kuboreshwa kwa kuboresha gari lako kwenye karakana ya marekebisho [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Asphalt rating", "[ICON1] Ukadiriaji wa lami", ["ICON"]], ["Off-road rating", "[ICON1] Ukadiriaji wa nje ya barabara", ["ICON"]], ["If the rating doesn't meet the requirements, you'll have to bring another vehicle or rent one for a fee.", "Ikiwa ukadiriaji haufikii mahitaji, utalazimika kuleta gari jingine au kukodisha moja kwa ada.", []], ["Tip: Get in a vehicle and hold to reveal a vehicle's stats, including its race ratings.", "Kidokezo: Ingia kwenye gari na ushikilie [DPAD-LEFT] kuonyesha takwimu za gari, pamoja na ukadiriaji wake wa mbio.", ["DPAD-LEFT"]], ["Look for a Top Fun van in spots around Leonida to enter drone time trials and win cash prizes.", "Tafuta gari la Top Fun katika maeneo kote Leonida ili kushiriki mashindano ya muda ya droni na kushinda zawadi za pesa.", []], ["Pilot a drone around a variety of courses as fast as possible without missing any checkpoints. While racing, hold to fly up and to fly down.", "Rusha droni kwenye njia mbalimbali kwa kasi uwezavyo bila kukosa kituo chochote cha ukaguzi. Ukishindana, shikilia [R2] kupaa juu na [L2] kushuka chini.", ["R2", "L2"]], ["Tip: Hold and steer with to keep your momentum when flying the drone.", "Kidokezo: Shikilia [LEFT-STICK] na uelekeze kwa [RIGHT-STICK] ili kudumisha kasi unaporusha droni.", ["LEFT-STICK", "RIGHT-STICK"]], ["Prove your marksmanship and earn rewards at Leonida's shooting ranges.", "Thibitisha ustadi wako wa kulenga na upate zawadi kwenye viwanja vya kulenga shabaha vya Leonida.", []], ["Visit Rodgers Ranch & Shooting Range near Port Gellhorn and test your aim by taking out stationary and mobile targets.", "Tembelea Rodgers Ranch & Shooting Range karibu na Port Gellhorn na ujaribu ulengaji wako kwa kuangusha shabaha zilizosimama na zinazosonga.", []], ["Visit Griffin Shooting Range in Balsero and complete its timed run-and-gun ranges. You can also test your weapons at their free fire range.", "Tembelea Griffin Shooting Range huko Balsero na ukamilishe viwanja vyake vya kukimbia na kufyatua kwa muda. Unaweza pia kujaribu silaha zako kwenye uwanja wao wa kufyatua huru.", []], ["Tip: Use combat focus to line up your shots and improve your accuracy.", "Kidokezo: Tumia umakini vitani [L3] [R3] kupanga risasi zako na kuboresha usahihi wako.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Look for places to perform stunt jumps around Leonida. These include ramps, construction sites, and more. Track how many you've completed in the Progress menu.", "Tafuta maeneo ya kufanya miruko ya kistadi kote Leonida. Haya ni pamoja na njia za kupandia, maeneo ya ujenzi na mengineyo. Fuatilia ngapi umekamilisha katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["While jumping, use to control your vehicle in the air. Use to change the speed of the cinematic camera, or press to exit it.", "Unaporuka, tumia [LEFT-STICK] kudhibiti gari lako hewani. Tumia [RIGHT-STICK] kubadilisha kasi ya kamera ya kisinema, au bonyeza [R3] kuitoka.", ["LEFT-STICK", "RIGHT-STICK", "R3"]], ["Tip: Each stunt jump has a unique challenge to complete. View the challenge in the map after the jump is discovered.", "Kidokezo: Kila mruko wa kistadi una changamoto ya kipekee ya kukamilisha. Tazama changamoto kwenye ramani baada ya mruko kugunduliwa.", []], ["Perform base jumps from towers, clifftops, and other high places. Any you've discovered or completed can be viewed in the Progress menu.", "Fanya miruko ya base kutoka minara, vilele vya majabali na mahali pengine pa juu. Yoyote uliyogundua au kukamilisha inaweza kutazamwa katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["Press to deploy your parachute at the right moment.", "Bonyeza [X] kufungua parachuti yako kwa wakati sahihi.", ["X"]], ["Press or to make sharp turns. Hold to descend faster or to slow down.", "Bonyeza [L2] au [R2] kufanya kona kali. Shikilia [LEFT-STICK] kushuka haraka zaidi au [LEFT-STICK] kupunguza kasi.", ["L2", "R2", "LEFT-STICK", "LEFT-STICK"]], ["Tip: You'll usually find a parachute at the site of a base jump.", "Kidokezo: Kwa kawaida utapata parachuti mahali pa mruko wa base.", []], ["Perform an under the bridge stunt by flying an aircraft safely under a bridge.", "Fanya kitimbi cha chini ya daraja kwa kurusha ndege salama chini ya daraja.", []], ["Perform a knife flight by rolling an airplane 90 degrees to slip through a tight gap between tall buildings in Vice City.", "Fanya kitimbi cha ncha ya kisu kwa kubingirisha ndege nyuzi 90 ili kupenya kwenye mwanya mwembamba kati ya majengo marefu huko Vice City.", []], ["You can review the stunts you've discovered in the Progress menu.", "Unaweza kupitia vitimbi ulivyogundua katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["Tip: Small, agile aircraft are best suited for aerial stunts. Maneuverability is more useful than speed.", "Kidokezo: Ndege ndogo na nyepesi zinafaa zaidi kwa vitimbi vya angani. Wepesi wa kugeuka ni muhimu kuliko kasi.", []], ["Work out at a gym to improve your stats and change your body shape.", "Fanya mazoezi kwenye gym ili kuboresha takwimu zako na kubadilisha umbo la mwili wako.", []], ["To use a gym, buy a membership at the front desk. Leonida's gyms range from basic to high-end, with different facilities and equipment.", "Ili kutumia gym, nunua uanachama kwenye meza ya mapokezi. Gym za Leonida zinatofautiana kutoka za kawaida hadi za kifahari, zikiwa na huduma na vifaa tofauti.", []], ["Use the Fitness app to track your workouts, calorie intake, and overall progress.", "Tumia programu ya Siha [ICON1] kufuatilia mazoezi yako, kalori unazokula na maendeleo kwa jumla.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: You can also find workout equipment like weight benches around Leonida.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza pia kupata vifaa vya mazoezi kama mabenchi ya kunyanyua uzito kote Leonida.", []], ["Leonida has many popular nightlife spots from local dive bars to high-end nightclubs", "Leonida ina maeneo mengi maarufu ya starehe za usiku [ICON1] kuanzia baa za mtaani hadi klabu za usiku za kifahari [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["These venues offer music and dancing. Some will also have a jukebox, pool tables arcade games, and offer private services.", "Maeneo haya yanatoa muziki na dansi. Baadhi pia yatakuwa na jukebox, meza za pool [ICON1] michezo ya arcade, na kutoa huduma za faragha.", ["ICON"]], ["Check the Activities section of the map index for clubs you've discovered.", "Angalia sehemu ya Shughuli [ICON1] katika faharasa ya ramani [TOUCHPAD] kwa klabu ulizogundua.", ["ICON", "TOUCHPAD"]], ["Tip: View regular bars and restaurants in the Food & Drink section of the map index.", "Kidokezo: Tazama baa na mikahawa ya kawaida katika sehemu ya Vyakula na Vinywaji [ICON1] ya faharasa ya ramani.", ["ICON"]], ["Play pool at various venues around Leonida like the Rusty Anchor You can practice solo or take on an opponent to win some cash.", "Cheza pool katika maeneo mbalimbali kote Leonida kama Rusty Anchor [ICON1] Unaweza kujizoeza peke yako au kushindana na mpinzani ili kushinda pesa.", ["ICON"]], ["If a venue has a pool table, it will appear on the details card when selecting it on the map.", "Ikiwa eneo lina meza ya pool, itaonekana kwenye kadi ya maelezo unapolichagua kwenye ramani.", []], ["Start a game by picking up a cue or take on an opponent by interacting with them.", "Anza mchezo kwa kuokota fimbo [L1] au shindana na mpinzani kwa kuwasiliana naye.", ["L1"]], ["Tip: Jason and Lucia can also play pool together.", "Kidokezo: Jason na Lucia wanaweza pia kucheza pool pamoja.", []], ["There are basketball hoops all around Leonida. Find a ball nearby, then hold and release to shoot. Increase your accuracy by releasing at the right point of your shot.", "Kuna pete za mpira wa kikapu kote Leonida. Tafuta mpira karibu, kisha shikilia na uachilie [R2] kurusha. Ongeza usahihi wako kwa kuachilia [R2] kwa wakati sahihi wa urushaji wako.", ["R2", "R2"]], ["To aim your shot, hold then hold and release when the two reticle rings overlap.", "Ili kulenga urushaji wako, shikilia [L2] kisha shikilia na uachilie [R2] pete mbili za kilengeo zinapopishana.", ["L2", "R2"]], ["Shoot while running towards the hoop to do a layup.", "Rusha ukikimbia kuelekea pete ili kufanya layup.", []], ["Tip: If you lose sight of the ball, focus to highlight it.", "Kidokezo: Ukipoteza mpira machoni, tumia umakini [L3] [R3] kuuangazia.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Play either 9 or 18 holes of mini golf at two locations in Leonida.", "Cheza mashimo 9 au 18 ya gofu ndogo katika maeneo mawili huko Leonida.", []], ["Frontier Adventure Golf is a Wild West-themed course in Leonard County.", "Frontier Adventure Golf ni uwanja wenye mandhari ya Wild West huko Leonard County.", []], ["King Gator Adventure Golf is a swamp-themed course in Kelly County.", "King Gator Adventure Golf ni uwanja wenye mandhari ya kinamasi huko Kelly County.", []], ["Play each hole in order, taking the fewest strokes possible to maximize your score.", "Cheza kila shimo kwa mpangilio, ukitumia mapigo machache iwezekanavyo ili kuongeza alama zako.", []], ["Tip: You can play for free at the abandoned Dino Golf course in Frogswater.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kucheza bure kwenye uwanja uliotelekezwa wa Dino Golf huko Frogswater.", []], ["Leonida is home to two traditional golf courses.", "Leonida ina viwanja viwili vya gofu vya kawaida.", []], ["Mount Hailes Country Club has an 18-hole course in Leonard County.", "Mount Hailes Country Club ina uwanja wa mashimo 18 huko Leonard County.", []], ["Leaf Links is an exclusive 9-hole course in Vice Beach.", "Leaf Links ni uwanja wa kipekee wa mashimo 9 huko Vice Beach.", []], ["Find a club and head to the nearest tee. Play all holes in any order, taking the fewest strokes possible for the best result.", "Tafuta fimbo ya gofu na uelekee kwenye tee iliyo karibu. Cheza mashimo yote kwa mpangilio wowote, ukitumia mapigo machache iwezekanavyo kwa matokeo bora.", []], ["Tip: These courses are private property. Be wary of on-site security as you play.", "Kidokezo: Viwanja hivi ni mali binafsi. Jihadhari na walinzi wa eneo unapocheza.", []], ["Play console games at home and arcade games in bars and venues around Leonida.", "Cheza michezo ya konsoli nyumbani na michezo ya arcade kwenye baa na maeneo kote Leonida.", []], ["Bang For Your Buck is an arcade game where you hunt animals to earn rewards.", "Bang For Your Buck ni mchezo wa arcade [ICON1] ambapo unawinda wanyama ili kupata zawadi.", ["ICON"]], ["Street Trash 3: DeZombifier is an extraction shooter, available on arcade machines and home consoles.", "Street Trash 3: DeZombifier ni mchezo wa kufyatua wa kutoroka, unaopatikana kwenye mashine za arcade na konsoli za nyumbani.", []], ["Time Jackers: Rewind is a twin-stick sci-fi shooter, and Tenebrae Lux is an indie puzzle game. Both are available on home consoles.", "Time Jackers: Rewind ni mchezo wa kufyatua wa sayansi ya kubuni wa vijiti viwili, na Tenebrae Lux ni mchezo huru wa mafumbo. Yote mawili yanapatikana kwenye konsoli za nyumbani.", []], ["Tip: While playing, press to open the game's pause menu while playing to exit or restart.", "Kidokezo: Unapocheza, bonyeza [TOUCHPAD] kufungua menyu ya kusitisha ya mchezo ili kutoka au kuanza upya.", ["TOUCHPAD"]], ["Fish can be caught in Leonida's rivers, lakes, and oceans. When you discover the best spots for catching the biggest fish, they'll be marked on the map", "Samaki wanaweza kuvuliwa kwenye mito, maziwa na bahari za Leonida. Ukigundua maeneo bora ya kuvua samaki wakubwa zaidi, yatawekewa alama kwenye ramani [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["The best times to catch large fish are sunrise and sunset. Bad weather will make fish harder to catch.", "Nyakati bora za kuvua samaki wakubwa ni macheo na machweo. Hali mbaya ya hewa itafanya samaki kuwa vigumu kuvua.", []], ["While fishing, press to focus and see where the fish are, then aim your cast at that spot.", "Unapovua, bonyeza [L3] [R3] kutumia umakini na kuona samaki walipo, kisha lenga urushaji wa ndoano yako mahali hapo.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Hold in any direction to stop a hooked fish pulling out more line, but be careful not to snap it.", "Shikilia [RIGHT-STICK] upande wowote kumzuia samaki aliyenaswa asivute uzi zaidi, lakini kuwa mwangalifu usiukate.", ["RIGHT-STICK"]], ["Tip: Press to flick the lure. This will attract fish, but overuse will scare them away.", "Kidokezo: Bonyeza [R2] kutikisa chambo. Hii itavutia samaki, lakini ukizidisha utawatisha.", ["R2"]], ["Lures come in various sizes for both freshwater and saltwater fish.", "Chambo bandia huja kwa ukubwa mbalimbali kwa samaki wa maji baridi na maji ya chumvi.", []], ["Be sure to choose the right lure for the fish species you want to catch. You can buy fishing lures at certain Ammu-Nations", "Hakikisha unachagua chambo sahihi kwa aina ya samaki unayotaka kuvua. Unaweza kununua chambo bandia za uvuvi kwenye baadhi ya maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Catching a fish will also add its information and its recommended lure to the Progress menu.", "Kidokezo: Kuvua samaki pia kutaongeza taarifa zake na chambo kinachopendekezwa kwenye menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["While looking through binoculars or a sniper rifle, hold to study an animal.", "Unapotazama kupitia darubini au bunduki ya kulenga mbali, shikilia [R1] kumchunguza mnyama.", ["R1"]], ["Studying an animal tells you more about the species, including the best weapon to take it down clean.", "Kumchunguza mnyama kunakupa habari zaidi kuhusu spishi hiyo, pamoja na silaha bora ya kumwangusha kwa usafi.", []], ["Tip: Check the Progress menu to review information about the animals you've studied.", "Kidokezo: Angalia menyu ya Maendeleo kupitia taarifa kuhusu wanyama uliowachunguza.", []], ["Hold to open your loadout.", "Shikilia [L1] kufungua mzigo wako.", ["L1"]], ["You can carry two sidearms and two longarms in your loadout at one time. There is also room for explosives, a melee weapon, and equipment like binoculars and a flashlight.", "Unaweza kubeba bastola mbili na bunduki ndefu mbili kwenye mzigo wako kwa wakati mmoja. Pia kuna nafasi ya vilipuzi, silaha ya mapigano ya karibu, na vifaa kama darubini na tochi.", []], ["Tip: Manage your loadout and swap weapons at a weapon locker in an Ammu-Nation, or use your personal vehicle's trunk", "Kidokezo: Dhibiti mzigo wako na ubadilishe silaha kwenye kabati la silaha [ICON1] ndani ya Ammu-Nation, au tumia buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Hold to open your loadout, then press to view your items.", "Shikilia [L1] kufungua mzigo wako, kisha bonyeza [R1] kutazama vitu vyako.", ["L1", "R1"]], ["The loadout will show anything you're carrying, including smokes, accessories, and gear.", "Mzigo utaonyesha chochote unachobeba, pamoja na sigara, mapambo na zana.", []], ["You can press to put on or take off accessories and to swap the wear style of certain items of clothing.", "Unaweza kubonyeza [X] kuvaa au kuvua mapambo na [DPAD] kubadilisha mtindo wa uvaaji wa baadhi ya mavazi.", ["X", "DPAD"]], ["Tip: Change your accessories to prevent the cops from recognizing your appearance", "Kidokezo: Badilisha mapambo yako ili kuwazuia polisi kutambua mwonekano wako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Use the trunk of your personal vehicle to store and transport items, swap weapons in your loadout, and change outfits.", "Tumia buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] kuhifadhi na kusafirisha vitu, kubadilisha silaha kwenye mzigo wako na kubadilisha mavazi.", ["ICON"]], ["You can use the trunk of an unowned vehicle to transport items, but not to manage your loadout or change your outfit.", "Unaweza kutumia buti la gari usilolimiliki [ICON1] kusafirisha vitu, lakini si kudhibiti mzigo wako au kubadilisha mavazi yako.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Stash bags in your trunk may be lost if you don't escape the cops after hitting a location.", "Kidokezo: Mifuko ya kuhifadhi kwenye buti lako [ICON1] inaweza kupotea usipowatoroka polisi baada ya kuvamia eneo.", ["ICON"]], ["When you collect valuables from a robbery, they'll go into your stash bag.", "Unapokusanya vitu vya thamani kutoka kwenye unyang'anyi, vitaingia kwenye mfuko wako wa kuhifadhi.", []], ["Stow stash bags in the trunk of your vehicle before heading to a drop-off for easy transport.", "Weka mifuko ya kuhifadhi kwenye buti la gari lako [ICON1] kabla ya kuelekea mahali pa kukabidhi ili kusafirisha kwa urahisi.", ["ICON"]], ["You can check the value and contents of a stash bag in your loadout", "Unaweza kuangalia thamani na yaliyomo kwenye mfuko wa kuhifadhi katika mzigo wako [L1]", ["L1"]], ["Tip: If you accidentally die or lose your bag in a less populated area, it may be recoverable. Check the map to see if it's still there.", "Kidokezo: Ukifa au kupoteza mfuko wako kwa bahati mbaya katika eneo lenye watu wachache, huenda ukaweza kuurejesha. Angalia ramani [TOUCHPAD] kuona kama bado upo.", ["TOUCHPAD"]], ["Owned weapons are purchased from Ammu-Nations around Leonida.", "Silaha unazomiliki [ICON1] hununuliwa kwenye maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON2] kote Leonida.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Buying a weapon will give it to both Jason and Lucia, and can be modified and equipped independently.", "Kununua silaha kutawapa Jason na Lucia wote wawili, na inaweza kurekebishwa na kutumiwa na kila mmoja peke yake.", []], ["If dropped or lost, they can be recovered from your trunk or a weapon locker", "Zikiangushwa au kupotea, zinaweza kurejeshwa kutoka kwenye buti lako [ICON1] au kabati la silaha [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: Buying more weapons will expand the range of products offered at Ammu-Nations.", "Kidokezo: Kununua silaha zaidi kutapanua aina za bidhaa zinazotolewa kwenye maduka ya Ammu-Nation.", []], ["Unowned weapons are dropped by enemies or found in the world ambiently. They cannot be owned or modified.", "Silaha usizomiliki [ICON1] huangushwa na maadui au hupatikana ulimwenguni. Haziwezi kumilikiwa wala kurekebishwa.", ["ICON"]], ["If lost, they can't be recovered. They will also be removed if you get wasted or busted.", "Zikipotea, haziwezi kurejeshwa. Pia zitaondolewa ukiuawa au ukikamatwa.", []], ["Tip: A limited amount of unowned weapons can be stowed in your trunk", "Kidokezo: Idadi ndogo ya silaha usizomiliki inaweza kuwekwa kwenye buti lako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Unique variants are bespoke weapons discovered while exploring, and can't be modified.", "Aina maalum [ICON1] ni silaha za kipekee zinazogunduliwa unapozunguka, na haziwezi kurekebishwa.", ["ICON"]], ["Once picked up, a unique variant is permanently unlocked for both characters.", "Ukishaiokota, aina maalum inafunguliwa kwa kudumu kwa wahusika wote wawili.", []], ["Switch between customizable owned weapons and any unique variants you've found at a weapon locker", "Badilisha kati ya silaha unazomiliki zinazoweza kurekebishwa na aina maalum ulizopata kwenye kabati la silaha [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Track which unique variants you've discovered using the Weapons section of the Progress menu.", "Kidokezo: Fuatilia aina maalum ulizogundua kwa kutumia sehemu ya Silaha katika menyu ya Maendeleo.", []], ["Purchase new weapons, equipment, and mods at any Ammu-Nation", "Nunua silaha mpya, vifaa na marekebisho kwenye Ammu-Nation yoyote [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Owners will notice if you buy up a lot of their stock. They'll eventually expand their range of products and some higher-end items will become available for purchase.", "Wamiliki wataona ukinunua bidhaa zao nyingi. Hatimaye watapanua aina za bidhaa zao na baadhi ya vitu vya hadhi ya juu vitapatikana kununuliwa.", []], ["Tip: Larger stores will sell a wider range of weapons and offer exclusive cosmetic options.", "Kidokezo: Maduka makubwa zaidi yatauza aina nyingi zaidi za silaha na kutoa machaguo ya kipekee ya mwonekano.", []], ["Most Ammu-Nations have a weapon locker.", "Maduka mengi ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] yana kabati la silaha.", ["ICON"]], ["Use it to recover owned weapons, manage your loadout, or select weapon variants", "Litumie kurejesha silaha unazomiliki, kudhibiti mzigo wako au kuchagua aina za silaha [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: You can also move weapons to your personal vehicle's trunk for easier access on the go.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza pia kuhamisha silaha kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] ili kuzifikia kwa urahisi ukiwa safarini.", ["ICON"]], ["Ammu-Nations will offer weapon mods to improve its stats and performance.", "Maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] yatatoa marekebisho ya silaha ili kuboresha takwimu na utendaji wake.", ["ICON"]], ["Attachments include custom grips magazines optics and more. Suppressors and tactical flashlights can be equipped and removed in your loadout. Other attachments can only be managed at an Ammu-Nation.", "Viambatisho ni pamoja na vishikio maalum [ICON1] magazini [ICON2] lenzi za kulenga [ICON3] na zaidi. Vizuia sauti na tochi za kimbinu vinaweza kuwekwa na kuondolewa kwenye mzigo wako. Viambatisho vingine vinaweza kudhibitiwa kwenye Ammu-Nation pekee.", ["ICON", "ICON", "ICON"]], ["Hold to check your weapon stats and attached mods anytime in your loadout.", "Shikilia [L1] kuangalia takwimu za silaha yako na marekebisho yaliyoambatishwa wakati wowote kwenye mzigo wako.", ["L1"]], ["Tip: Hold with a weapon equipped to quickly compare stats with a found weapon on the ground.", "Kidokezo: Shikilia [L1] ukiwa umeshika silaha ili kulinganisha haraka takwimu na silaha uliyoipata ardhini.", ["L1"]], ["Ammu-Nations offer equipment for purchase, such as body armor, ammo packs, and explosives packs.", "Maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] yanauza vifaa, kama kinga ya mwili, mikoba ya risasi na mikoba ya vilipuzi.", ["ICON"]], ["Ammo and explosives packs will be sent to your personal vehicle trunk on purchase. Taking them out of your trunk will refill your equipped weapon ammunition and explosives.", "Mikoba ya risasi na vilipuzi itatumwa kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] unaponunua. Kuitoa kwenye buti lako kutajaza upya risasi na vilipuzi vya silaha uliyoshika.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Keep extra equipment in your trunk to restock your supplies on the go or ahead of a job.", "Kidokezo: Weka vifaa vya ziada kwenye buti lako ili kujaza upya mahitaji yako ukiwa safarini au kabla ya kazi.", []], ["Use the wardrobe in your safehouse to change your clothes. It contains any clothing you've bought at stores.", "Tumia kabati la nguo kwenye nyumba yako salama [ICON1] kubadilisha nguo zako. Lina nguo zote ulizonunua madukani.", ["ICON"]], ["While choosing your clothes, examine your appearance by using to spin around or to zoom in. While zoomed in, use to focus on different items of clothing.", "Unapochagua nguo zako, kagua mwonekano wako kwa kutumia [RIGHT-STICK] kuzunguka au [R2] kukuza. Ukiwa umekuza, tumia [DPAD] kuangazia mavazi tofauti.", ["RIGHT-STICK", "R2", "DPAD"]], ["Tip: You can also change clothes in the changing room at some stores.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza pia kubadilisha nguo kwenye chumba cha kubadilishia [ICON1] katika baadhi ya maduka.", ["ICON"]], ["Use the wardrobe to create and save up to 10 custom outfits.", "Tumia kabati la nguo [ICON1] kuunda na kuhifadhi hadi mavazi kamili 10 maalum.", ["ICON"]], ["You can also add up to five outfits to the trunk of your personal vehicle to change on the go.", "Unaweza pia kuongeza hadi mavazi kamili matano kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] ili kubadilisha ukiwa safarini.", ["ICON"]], ["Changing your outfit is a useful way to prevent the cops from recognizing you", "Kubadilisha mavazi yako ni njia nzuri ya kuwazuia polisi wasikutambue [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: If you're wanted by the cops but didn't bring a change of clothes, you can steal an outfit from a clothing store.", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa unasakwa na polisi lakini hukuleta nguo za kubadilisha, unaweza kuiba mavazi kutoka kwenye duka la nguo.", []], ["Use the wardrobe to manage accessories, like masks, headwear, and eyewear. You can put on or take off accessories in your loadout.", "Tumia kabati la nguo [ICON1] kudhibiti mapambo, kama barakoa, vazi la kichwa na miwani. Unaweza kuvaa au kuvua mapambo kwenye mzigo wako.", ["ICON"]], ["You can also add up to three of each type of accessory to the trunk of your personal vehicle to change on the go.", "Unaweza pia kuongeza hadi mapambo matatu ya kila aina kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] ili kubadilisha ukiwa safarini.", ["ICON"]], ["Change your accessories to prevent the cops from recognizing you after a crime. Be sure to change all the accessories you're wearing", "Badilisha mapambo yako ili kuwazuia polisi wasikutambue baada ya uhalifu. Hakikisha unabadilisha mapambo yote uliyovaa [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Save any found accessories in the wardrobe so you don't lose them when changing outfits.", "Kidokezo: Hifadhi mapambo yoyote uliyopata kwenye kabati la nguo ili usiyapoteze unapobadilisha mavazi.", []], ["Clothing stores will offer different options for Jason and Lucia. Try visiting a store as each of them to see what's on offer.", "Maduka ya nguo yatatoa machaguo tofauti kwa Jason na Lucia. Jaribu kutembelea duka kama kila mmoja wao ili kuona kinachopatikana.", []], ["The different clothing stores you've discovered are categorized in the map index, ranging from thrift to formalwear.", "Maduka mbalimbali ya nguo uliyogundua yamepangwa katika faharasa ya ramani, kuanzia ya mitumba hadi mavazi rasmi.", []], ["Tip: Any new clothing you purchase will be added to Jason or Lucia's wardrobe", "Kidokezo: Nguo mpya zozote utakazonunua zitaongezwa kwenye kabati la nguo la Jason au Lucia [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Purchase headphones at any electronics store Access them by opening your loadout then pressing", "Nunua vipokea sauti kwenye duka lolote la vifaa vya kielektroniki [ICON1] Vifikie kwa kufungua mzigo wako [L1] kisha kubonyeza [R1]", ["ICON", "L1", "R1"]], ["Headphones allow you to listen to the radio on foot. Hold to select a station, and press to turn them on or off.", "Vipokea sauti vinakuruhusu kusikiliza redio ukiwa kwa miguu. Shikilia [DPAD-LEFT] kuchagua kituo, na bonyeza [X] kuviwasha au kuvizima.", ["DPAD-LEFT", "X"]], ["Tip: Getting into a fight can knock off your headphones. Be sure to pick them up afterwards if you get in an altercation.", "Kidokezo: Kupigana kunaweza kuangusha vipokea sauti vyako. Hakikisha unaviokota baadaye ukiingia kwenye ugomvi.", []], ["All motorcycles, scooters, and bicycles come with a helmet. Access it by opening your loadout then press", "Pikipiki zote, skuta na baiskeli huja na kofia ngumu. Ifikie kwa kufungua mzigo wako [L1] kisha bonyeza [R1]", ["L1", "R1"]], ["Tip: You can set your helmet to auto equip in the Gameplay tab of the Settings menu.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kuweka kofia yako ngumu ivaliwe kiotomatiki katika kichupo cha Uchezaji cha menyu ya Mipangilio.", []], ["Jason and Lucia's behavior and actions are reflected in their criminal profiles. Keep track of them in the Jason & Lucia menu or check them quickly on the HUD by holding", "Tabia na vitendo vya Jason na Lucia vinaonekana katika wasifu wao wa kihalifu. Vifuatilie katika menyu ya Jason na Lucia [TOUCHPAD] au viangalie haraka kwenye HUD kwa kushikilia [DPAD-RIGHT]", ["TOUCHPAD", "DPAD-RIGHT"]], ["Professional", "[ICON1] Mtaalamu", ["ICON"]], ["Hardened", "[ICON1] Sugu", ["ICON"]], ["Violent", "[ICON1] Mkatili", ["ICON"]], ["Psycho", "[ICON1] Kichaa", ["ICON"]], ["Irredeemable", "[ICON1] Asiyekombolewa", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Jason and Lucia's profiles will change over time, and their status may have a lasting impact.", "Kidokezo: Wasifu wa Jason na Lucia utabadilika kadiri muda unavyopita, na hali yao inaweza kuwa na athari ya kudumu.", []], ["Jason and Lucia's criminal profiles are affected by their behavior. If they avoid violence and complete objectives cleanly, this will push their profiles toward professional", "Wasifu wa kihalifu wa Jason na Lucia huathiriwa na tabia zao. Wakiepuka vurugu na kukamilisha malengo kwa usafi, hili litasukuma wasifu wao kuelekea mtaalamu [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Using extreme violence can have the opposite effect, pushing their criminal profiles toward violent or even psycho", "Kutumia vurugu kali kunaweza kuwa na athari tofauti, kukisukuma wasifu wao wa kihalifu kuelekea mkatili [ICON1] au hata kichaa [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: Jason and Lucia's profiles are separate, but their actions can influence each other when together.", "Kidokezo: Wasifu wa Jason na Lucia ni tofauti, lakini vitendo vyao vinaweza kuathiriana wakiwa pamoja.", []], ["A criminal with a professional profile commits crimes cleanly, avoiding casualties and unnecessary aggression, and doing only what's required to get the job done.", "Mhalifu mwenye wasifu wa mtaalamu hufanya uhalifu kwa usafi, akiepuka vifo na uchokozi usio wa lazima, na kufanya tu kinachohitajika kukamilisha kazi.", []], ["Maintain a professional criminal profile by generally avoiding violence unless threatened, and going undetected while committing certain crimes. Making threats won't affect your profile.", "Dumisha wasifu wa kihalifu wa mtaalamu kwa kuepuka vurugu kwa jumla isipokuwa ukitishiwa, na kutogunduliwa unapofanya uhalifu fulani. Kutoa vitisho hakutaathiri wasifu wako.", []], ["Tip: If your criminal profile is professional, thoughtful actions and non-lethal incapacitations will increase your focus", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa wasifu wako wa kihalifu ni mtaalamu, vitendo vya busara na ulemazaji usio wa kuua vitaongeza umakini wako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["A criminal with a hardened profile uses force to achieve their goals and doesn't hesitate to kill enemies, even if it means being detected.", "Mhalifu mwenye wasifu sugu hutumia nguvu kufikia malengo yake na hasiti kuua maadui, hata ikimaanisha kugunduliwa.", []], ["To move your profile from hardened to professional, find ways to avoid violence and keep the destruction you cause to a minimum.", "Ili kuhamisha wasifu wako kutoka sugu hadi mtaalamu, tafuta njia za kuepuka vurugu na upunguze uharibifu unaosababisha.", []], ["Harming civilians or killing cops may turn your profile from hardened to violent.", "Kuwadhuru raia au kuua polisi kunaweza kugeuza wasifu wako kutoka sugu hadi mkatili.", []], ["Tip: If your criminal profile is hardened, thoughtful actions and non-lethal incapacitations will increase your focus", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa wasifu wako wa kihalifu ni sugu, vitendo vya busara na ulemazaji usio wa kuua vitaongeza umakini wako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["A criminal with a violent profile attacks cops and civilians indiscriminately, ignoring non-lethal options.", "Mhalifu mwenye wasifu mkatili huwashambulia polisi na raia bila kubagua, akipuuza njia zisizo za kuua.", []], ["Killing cops and attacking fleeing civilians can contribute to a violent criminal profile, but acting in self-defense will not.", "Kuua polisi na kuwashambulia raia wanaokimbia kunaweza kuchangia wasifu wa kihalifu mkatili, lakini kujihami hakutachangia.", []], ["Extreme violence may turn your profile from violent to psycho. To move it back toward hardened, avoid unnecessary violence and do only what's required to get the job done.", "Vurugu kali zinaweza kugeuza wasifu wako kutoka mkatili hadi kichaa. Ili kuurudisha kuelekea sugu, epuka vurugu zisizo za lazima na ufanye tu kinachohitajika kukamilisha kazi.", []], ["Tip: If your criminal profile is violent, headshots will increase your focus", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa wasifu wako wa kihalifu ni mkatili, risasi za kichwani zitaongeza umakini wako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["A criminal with a psycho profile indulges in extreme violence.", "Mhalifu mwenye wasifu wa kichaa hujiingiza katika vurugu kali.", []], ["Regularly murdering defenseless civilians, killing a lot of cops, and killing domestic and vulnerable animals will contribute to a psycho profile.", "Kuwaua mara kwa mara raia wasio na uwezo wa kujitetea, kuua polisi wengi, na kuua wanyama wa kufugwa na walio hatarini kutachangia wasifu wa kichaa.", []], ["A psycho criminal profile puts you at risk of becoming irredeemable. If you reach a breaking point you may want to reconsider your actions to avoid a permanent impact to your profile.", "Wasifu wa kihalifu wa kichaa unakuweka hatarini kuwa asiyekombolewa. Ukifikia kikomo [ICON1] huenda ukataka kufikiria upya vitendo vyako ili kuepuka athari ya kudumu kwenye wasifu wako.", ["ICON"]], ["Move back toward professional by using non-lethal tactics, like shooting to incapacitate.", "Rudi kuelekea mtaalamu kwa kutumia mbinu zisizo za kuua, kama kufyatua ili kulemaza.", []], ["Tip: If your criminal profile is psycho, headshots will increase your focus but surrendering to the cops is no longer an option.", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa wasifu wako wa kihalifu ni kichaa, risasi za kichwani zitaongeza umakini wako [ICON1] lakini kujisalimisha kwa polisi si chaguo tena.", ["ICON"]], ["When a criminal's behavior is excessively violent for long enough, they will become permanently irredeemable.", "Tabia ya mhalifu inapokuwa na vurugu kupita kiasi kwa muda wa kutosha, atakuwa asiyekombolewa milele.", []], ["Tip: Being irredeemable will have a lasting impact on Jason and Lucia.", "Kidokezo: Kuwa asiyekombolewa kutakuwa na athari ya kudumu kwa Jason na Lucia.", []], ["Jason and Lucia's relationship will change based on your choices, actions, and time spent together. Track it in the Jason & Lucia menu or by holding", "Uhusiano wa Jason na Lucia utabadilika kulingana na chaguo zako, vitendo vyako na muda mnaotumia pamoja. Ufuatilie katika menyu ya Jason na Lucia [TOUCHPAD] au kwa kushikilia [DPAD-RIGHT]", ["TOUCHPAD", "DPAD-RIGHT"]], ["Hot Together (4/4)", "[ICON1] Moto Pamoja (4/4)", ["ICON"]], ["Crazy in Love (3/4)", "[ICON1] Penzi la Kichaa (3/4)", ["ICON"]], ["Not So Hot (2/4)", "[ICON1] Si Moto Sana (2/4)", ["ICON"]], ["Running on Empty (1/4)", "[ICON1] Mafuta Yanaisha (1/4)", ["ICON"]], ["Build Jason and Lucia's relationship by spending time together, paying attention to each other, and showing affection.", "Jenga uhusiano wa Jason na Lucia [ICON1] kwa kutumia muda pamoja, kujaliana na kuonyesha mapenzi.", ["ICON"]], ["Small things can make a difference, like greeting your partner when you meet up, buying them a drink, or holding hands.", "Mambo madogo yanaweza kuleta tofauti, kama kumsalimia mshirika wako mnapokutana, kumnunulia kinywaji, au kushikana mikono.", []], ["You can also improve your relationship by completing certain tasks, doing robberies, and enjoying sports and leisure activities as a couple.", "Unaweza pia kuboresha uhusiano wenu kwa kukamilisha kazi fulani, kufanya unyang'anyi, na kufurahia michezo na shughuli za burudani kama wapenzi.", []], ["Tip: To have the strongest relationship, both Jason and Lucia need to contribute. Hold and press to switch characters.", "Kidokezo: Ili kuwa na uhusiano imara zaidi, Jason na Lucia wote wanahitaji kuchangia. Shikilia [DPAD-RIGHT] na ubonyeze [R1] kubadilisha wahusika.", ["DPAD-RIGHT", "R1"]], ["Jason and Lucia's relationship will suffer if you neglect or mistreat your partner.", "Uhusiano wa Jason na Lucia utaathirika [ICON1] ukimpuuza au kumtendea vibaya mshirika wako.", ["ICON"]], ["Ignoring your partner's calls and messages, spending lots of time apart, or abandoning them while traveling together can all drive a wedge between you and hurt your relationship.", "Kupuuza simu na ujumbe wa mshirika wako, kukaa mbali kwa muda mrefu, au kumwacha mnaposafiri pamoja kunaweza kuleta mfarakano kati yenu na kuumiza uhusiano wenu.", []], ["Tip: Even small acts of affection and consideration can add up over time to improve a relationship.", "Kidokezo: Hata vitendo vidogo vya mapenzi na kujali vinaweza kujumlika kadiri muda unavyopita na kuboresha uhusiano.", []], ["Jason and Lucia can each carry up to $20,000 in pocket cash and it's accepted by most businesses for smaller purchases.", "Jason na Lucia kila mmoja anaweza kubeba hadi $20,000 pesa taslimu mfukoni na zinakubaliwa na biashara nyingi kwa manunuzi madogo.", []], ["Tip: You can lose all your pocket cash if you're wasted or busted, so it's a good idea to not carry too much.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kupoteza pesa zako zote taslimu mfukoni ukiuawa au ukikamatwa, kwa hivyo ni wazo zuri kutobeba nyingi mno.", []], ["Stores and businesses in Leonida take pocket cash for purchases up to $1,000.", "Maduka na biashara za Leonida hupokea pesa taslimu mfukoni [ICON1] kwa manunuzi hadi $1,000.", ["ICON"]], ["For more expensive purchases you'll generally need to pay via BuckMe", "Kwa manunuzi ya bei ghali zaidi kwa kawaida utahitaji kulipa kupitia BuckMe [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Some services around Leonida are digital only, and will require a BuckMe account.", "Baadhi ya huduma kote Leonida ni za kidijitali pekee, na zitahitaji akaunti ya BuckMe.", []], ["Tip: If you're planning a larger purchase, make sure your BuckMe account has enough funds. You can deposit cash at any ATM", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa unapanga ununuzi mkubwa, hakikisha akaunti yako ya BuckMe ina fedha za kutosha. Unaweza kuweka pesa taslimu kwenye ATM yoyote [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Robbing people on the street is a quick way to make some cash. Aim your weapon at them and press to demand their valuables.", "Kuwapora watu mtaani ni njia ya haraka ya kupata pesa. Elekeza silaha yako kwao na ubonyeze [TRIANGLE] kudai vitu vyao vya thamani.", ["TRIANGLE"]], ["Tip: Wear a mask during a mugging, then take it off when you're out of sight so it's harder for cops to recognize you", "Kidokezo: Vaa barakoa wakati wa uporaji, kisha ivue ukiwa mbali na macho ya watu ili iwe vigumu kwa polisi kukutambua [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Convenience stores, restaurants, and liquor stores will have cash in their registers.", "Maduka ya bidhaa za kila siku, mikahawa na maduka ya pombe yatakuwa na pesa taslimu kwenye kaunta zao.", []], ["Aim your weapon at the staff and press to threaten them and demand cash. Keep your gun on them so they don't pull anything.", "Elekeza silaha yako kwa wafanyakazi na ubonyeze [SQUARE] kuwatishia na kudai pesa taslimu. Endelea kuwaelekezea bunduki ili wasifanye ujanja wowote.", ["SQUARE"]], ["Check the Robberies section of the map index for locations to hit.", "Angalia sehemu ya Unyang'anyi [ICON1] katika faharasa ya ramani kwa maeneo ya kuvamia.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Be on the lookout for CCTV and destroy any footage for a cleaner getaway.", "Kidokezo: Kuwa macho kwa CCTV [ICON1] na uharibu rekodi zozote ili kutoroka kwa usafi zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["Look out for illegal operations run by Leonida's criminals and gangs. They usually have a lot of valuables for the taking, but locations will be heavily guarded.", "Tafuta shughuli haramu zinazoendeshwa na wahalifu na magenge ya Leonida. Kwa kawaida huwa na vitu vingi vya thamani vya kuchukua, lakini maeneo yatakuwa na ulinzi mkali.", []], ["Plan your approach and come properly equipped. Focus to scope out a location and find opportunities to distract enemies or gain an advantage.", "Panga mbinu yako na uje ukiwa na vifaa vya kutosha. Tumia umakini [L3] [R3] kuchunguza eneo na kutafuta fursa za kuvuruga maadui au kupata faida.", ["L3", "R3"]], ["Check the Robberies section of the map index for a list of known operations.", "Angalia sehemu ya Unyang'anyi [ICON1] katika faharasa ya ramani kwa orodha ya shughuli zinazojulikana.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: After you hit an illegal operation, the criminals will disperse for a while before returning.", "Kidokezo: Baada ya kuvamia shughuli haramu, wahalifu watatawanyika kwa muda kabla ya kurudi.", []], ["Hail a cab or order one from Paradise Taxi by calling them from the Contacts app", "Simamisha teksi au agiza moja kutoka Paradise Taxi kwa kuwapigia simu kutoka programu ya Wawasiliani [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["You can also order a rideshare on the RydeMe app", "Unaweza pia kuagiza usafiri wa pamoja kwenye programu ya RydeMe [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Cabs and rideshares will drive you to most locations in Leonida, as long as it's reachable by car. You can talk to the driver to speed up the journey or skip it altogether.", "Teksi na usafiri wa pamoja vitakupeleka sehemu nyingi za Leonida, mradi zinafikika kwa gari. Unaweza kuongea na dereva ili kuharakisha safari au kuiruka kabisa.", []], ["Tip: Browse your phone during a journey by pressing", "Kidokezo: Vinjari simu yako wakati wa safari kwa kubonyeza [DPAD-UP]", ["DPAD-UP"]], ["A personal vehicle is your legally registered ride. Jason and Lucia can each have a vehicle of their own.", "Gari binafsi ni usafiri wako uliosajiliwa kisheria. Jason na Lucia kila mmoja anaweza kuwa na gari lake.", []], ["Personal vehicles can always be recovered if lost or destroyed.", "Magari binafsi yanaweza kurejeshwa daima yakipotea au kuharibiwa.", []], ["The trunk of a personal vehicle allows you to manage your loadout, change your outfit, and store and transport items like stash bags", "Buti la gari binafsi linakuruhusu kudhibiti mzigo wako, kubadilisha mavazi yako, na kuhifadhi na kusafirisha vitu kama mifuko ya kuhifadhi [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: The location of your personal vehicle is always marked on the map and can be found in the Personal section.", "Kidokezo: Mahali lilipo gari lako binafsi huwekewa alama kwenye ramani daima [ICON1] na linaweza kupatikana katika sehemu ya Binafsi [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["The last unowned vehicle you drove will be marked on the map", "Gari la mwisho usilolimiliki uliloendesha litawekewa alama kwenye ramani [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Unowned vehicles can't be recovered if lost or destroyed. Items will be removed from the trunk if you get wasted or busted.", "Magari usiyomiliki hayawezi kurejeshwa yakipotea au kuharibiwa. Vitu vitaondolewa kwenye buti ukiuawa au ukikamatwa.", []], ["You may come across standout vehicles as you explore Leonida. These vehicles have unique parts that can be lost if removed at a mod shop.", "Huenda ukakutana na magari ya kipekee [ICON1] unapozunguka Leonida. Magari haya yana sehemu za kipekee zinazoweza kupotea zikiondolewa kwenye karakana ya marekebisho.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: When breaking into a trunk, hold to clear it out and to stash your own items.", "Kidokezo: Unapovunja buti, shikilia [SQUARE] kulisafisha na kuweka vitu vyako mwenyewe.", ["SQUARE"]], ["If your vehicle takes enough damage, it will be destroyed and undrivable.", "Gari lako likiharibiwa vya kutosha, litaharibika kabisa na halitaweza kuendeshwa.", []], ["If this happens to your personal vehicle it can be recovered. Unowned vehicles can't be recovered and are permanently destroyed.", "Hili likitokea kwa gari lako binafsi linaweza kurejeshwa. Magari usiyomiliki hayawezi kurejeshwa na yanaharibika milele.", []], ["You can call Joey from your Contacts to have your vehicle repaired or delivered.", "Unaweza kumpigia Joey kutoka kwa Wawasiliani wako [ICON1] ili gari lako litengenezwe au liletwe.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: If your vehicle lands on its side or roof, approach it and hold to try and shove it back onto its wheels.", "Kidokezo: Gari lako likianguka ubavuni au juu chini, likaribie na ushikilie [SQUARE] kujaribu kulisukuma lirudi kwenye magurudumu yake.", ["SQUARE"]], ["If you're wasted or busted by the cops while using your personal vehicle, it may get impounded.", "Ukiuawa au ukikamatwa na polisi unapotumia gari lako binafsi, linaweza kuzuiliwa.", []], ["Check the Personal section of the map index to see where your vehicle is impounded. Any bags you had stashed in your trunk may be lost or locked in a police vehicle nearby.", "Angalia sehemu ya Binafsi [ICON1] katika faharasa ya ramani [ICON2] kuona mahali gari lako limezuiliwa. Mifuko yoyote uliyokuwa umeweka kwenye buti lako inaweza kupotea au kufungiwa kwenye gari la polisi lililo karibu.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: You can try stealing your vehicle and stash bags back from the impound lot, but get out quick before the cops ID you.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kujaribu kuiba tena gari lako na mifuko ya kuhifadhi kutoka kwenye yadi ya magari yaliyozuiliwa, lakini toka haraka kabla polisi hawajakutambua.", []], ["Hold to quickly open WAiNK then hold to scan a vehicle.", "Shikilia [DPAD-UP] kufungua haraka WAiNK [ICON1] kisha shikilia [R1] kuchanganua gari.", ["DPAD-UP", "ICON", "R1"]], ["Scanning will show a vehicle's stats, condition, and what kind of security it has installed, including alarms and trackers", "Kuchanganua kutaonyesha takwimu za gari, hali yake na aina ya usalama uliowekwa, pamoja na kengele [ICON1] na vifuatiliaji [ICON2] [ICON3]", ["ICON", "ICON", "ICON"]], ["You can also approach the hood of a vehicle you've been in and press to check the engine and view its details.", "Unaweza pia kukaribia boneti ya gari uliloingia na kubonyeza [L1] kuangalia injini na kutazama maelezo yake.", ["L1"]], ["Tip: View a vehicle's info while driving it by holding", "Kidokezo: Tazama taarifa za gari unapoliendesha kwa kushikilia [DPAD-LEFT]", ["DPAD-LEFT"]], ["Some vehicles are fitted with standard trackers", "Baadhi ya magari yamewekewa vifuatiliaji vya kawaida [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["If a vehicle has a tracker, it can't be modified until it's registered as yours. Once available, you can take vehicles with these trackers to a Pay 'n' Spray to register as your own, or sell for cash.", "Ikiwa gari lina kifuatiliaji, haliwezi kurekebishwa hadi lisajiliwe kuwa lako. Ikipatikana, unaweza kupeleka magari yenye vifuatiliaji hivi kwenye Pay 'n' Spray [ICON1] kuyasajili kuwa yako, au kuyauza kwa pesa taslimu.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Scan a vehicle with WAiNK to check if it has a tracker, or press while driving to check the vehicle stats on the HUD.", "Kidokezo: Changanua gari kwa WAiNK [ICON1] kuangalia kama lina kifuatiliaji, au bonyeza [DPAD-DOWN] unapoendesha kuangalia takwimu za gari kwenye HUD.", ["ICON", "DPAD-DOWN"]], ["High-end vehicles are often fitted with advanced trackers that notify the cops if the vehicle is stolen.", "Magari ya kifahari mara nyingi huwekewa vifuatiliaji vya hali ya juu [ICON1] vinavyowaarifu polisi gari likiibiwa.", ["ICON"]], ["An advanced tracker will transmit the vehicle's location to the cops unless moving at high speed.", "Kifuatiliaji cha hali ya juu kitatuma mahali gari lilipo kwa polisi isipokuwa likisonga kwa kasi kubwa.", []], ["If a vehicle has a tracker, it can't be modified until it's registered as yours. Once available, you can take it to a Pay 'n' Spray to register or sell it.", "Ikiwa gari lina kifuatiliaji, haliwezi kurekebishwa hadi lisajiliwe kuwa lako. Ikipatikana, unaweza kulipeleka kwenye Pay 'n' Spray [ICON1] kulisajili au kuliuza.", ["ICON"]], ["Your vehicle's engine can sustain damage from impacts and other hazards.", "Injini ya gari lako inaweza kuharibika kutokana na migongano na hatari nyingine.", []], ["Good condition", "[ICON1] Hali nzuri", ["ICON"]], ["Moderate damage", "[ICON1] Uharibifu wa wastani", ["ICON"]], ["Critical damage", "[ICON1] Uharibifu mkubwa", ["ICON"]], ["Engine destroyed", "[ICON1] Injini imeharibika kabisa", ["ICON"]], ["To have your vehicle repaired, visit a Pay 'n' Spray or mod shop", "Ili gari lako litengenezwe, tembelea Pay 'n' Spray [ICON1] au karakana ya marekebisho [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: You can also get minor repairs at a gas station", "Kidokezo: Unaweza pia kupata matengenezo madogo kwenye kituo cha mafuta [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Keep an eye on your vehicle's fuel level as you drive. A warning will appear on the HUD if it gets too low.", "Fuatilia kiwango cha mafuta cha gari lako unapoendesha. Onyo litaonekana kwenye HUD yakipungua sana.", []], ["Fuel high", "[ICON1] [ICON2] Mafuta mengi", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Fuel low", "[ICON1] [ICON2] Mafuta kidogo", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Fuel empty", "[ICON1] [ICON2] Mafuta yameisha", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Tip: Fill up at a gas station If you're driving an electric vehicle, recharge at an electric charging station", "Kidokezo: Jaza mafuta kwenye kituo cha mafuta [ICON1] Ikiwa unaendesha gari la umeme, chaji upya kwenye kituo cha kuchaji umeme [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Visit a mod shop to modify your vehicle. Mods can affect a vehicle's performance or its appearance.", "Tembelea karakana ya marekebisho [ICON1] [ICON2] kurekebisha gari lako. Marekebisho yanaweza kuathiri utendaji wa gari au mwonekano wake.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["While you're driving a vehicle, the mod shop that specializes in your vehicle type will be visible on the map, and will offer specialty parts and services.", "Unapoendesha gari, karakana ya marekebisho iliyobobea [ICON1] katika aina ya gari lako itaonekana kwenye ramani, na itatoa vipuri na huduma maalum.", ["ICON"]], ["They will also offer pro builds, installing a custom package of mods and cosmetics.", "Pia zitatoa miundo ya kitaalamu, zikiweka kifurushi maalum cha marekebisho na mapambo.", []], ["Tip: Explore mods from different shops to optimize your vehicle's stats.", "Kidokezo: Chunguza marekebisho kutoka karakana tofauti ili kuboresha takwimu za gari lako.", []], ["Press to check the door handle of a parked vehicle to see if it's locked. A quick but loud way to break in is to press to smash the window.", "Bonyeza [TRIANGLE] kujaribu kitasa cha mlango wa gari lililoegeshwa kuona kama limefungwa. Njia ya haraka lakini yenye kelele ya kuvunja ni kubonyeza [SQUARE] kuvunja dirisha.", ["TRIANGLE", "SQUARE"]], ["If the engine isn't running, you might need to hotwire it. Keyless vehicles can't be started without a key cloner.", "Ikiwa injini haiwaki, huenda ukahitaji kuliwasha bila ufunguo. Magari yasiyotumia ufunguo [ICON1] hayawezi kuwashwa bila kinakili ufunguo.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Smashing the window is a fast way in, but it can also set off an alarm", "Kidokezo: Kuvunja dirisha ni njia ya haraka ya kuingia, lakini pia kunaweza kuwasha kengele [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["If you break into a locked vehicle you'll need to hotwire it to start the engine.", "Ukivunja gari lililofungwa [ICON1] utahitaji kuliwasha bila ufunguo ili kuwasha injini.", ["ICON"]], ["To hotwire a vehicle, bring together and at the right spots to fill the semi-circles and start the engine.", "Ili kuwasha gari bila ufunguo, unganisha [LEFT-STICK] na [RIGHT-STICK] kwenye maeneo sahihi ili kujaza nusu-duara na kuwasha injini.", ["LEFT-STICK", "RIGHT-STICK"]], ["Tip: Keyless vehicles can't be physically hotwired and you'll need the right tools to steal one.", "Kidokezo: Magari yasiyotumia ufunguo [ICON1] hayawezi kuwashwa kwa nyaya na utahitaji zana sahihi ili kuiba moja.", ["ICON"]], ["While in a vehicle, hold to open the radio.", "Ukiwa ndani ya gari, shikilia [DPAD-LEFT] kufungua redio.", ["DPAD-LEFT"]], ["Vehicles will have other functions you can control, like headlights, windows, and more. Hold and use to view the available options.", "Magari yatakuwa na vipengele vingine unavyoweza kudhibiti, kama taa za mbele, madirisha na zaidi. Shikilia [DPAD-LEFT] na utumie [RIGHT-STICK] kutazama machaguo yanayopatikana.", ["DPAD-LEFT", "RIGHT-STICK"]], ["Tip: You can buy headphones at an electronics shop to listen to the radio on foot.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kununua vipokea sauti kwenye duka la vifaa vya kielektroniki [ICON1] ili kusikiliza redio ukiwa kwa miguu.", ["ICON"]], ["While driving, press to draw your sidearm and press to fire.", "Unapoendesha, bonyeza [L1] kuchomoa bastola yako na bonyeza [R1] kufyatua.", ["L1", "R1"]], ["Tip: Some vehicles will have weapons installed. Hold to select a vehicle weapon.", "Kidokezo: Baadhi ya magari yatakuwa na silaha zilizowekwa. Shikilia [L1] kuchagua silaha ya gari.", ["L1"]], ["When in a vehicle, hold to duck down and hide from the cops.", "Ukiwa ndani ya gari, shikilia [CIRCLE] kuinama na kujificha dhidi ya polisi.", ["CIRCLE"]], ["Tip: Even if you're on foot, find a parked vehicle and use this tactic to avoid detection.", "Kidokezo: Hata ukiwa kwa miguu, tafuta gari lililoegeshwa na utumie mbinu hii kuepuka kugunduliwa.", []], ["Hold while turning at speed to perform a handbrake turn and drift around sharp corners. This is handy for changing directions or making a U-turn in a hurry.", "Shikilia [X] unapogeuka kwa kasi kufanya kona ya breki ya mkono na kuteleza kwenye kona kali. Hii ni muhimu kubadilisha mwelekeo au kugeuza gari kwa haraka.", ["X"]], ["Tip: You can also do this while driving watercraft when you need to make a tight turn.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza pia kufanya hivi unapoendesha chombo cha majini unapohitaji kugeuka kwa nafasi finyu.", []], ["Hold while driving to fully stop your vehicle before getting out.", "Shikilia [TRIANGLE] unapoendesha kusimamisha gari lako kabisa kabla ya kushuka.", ["TRIANGLE"]], ["Double tap to jump out of a parked or moving vehicle and leave the engine running. If you're moving fast enough, this will jam the accelerator and send the vehicle speeding forward.", "Gusa [TRIANGLE] mara mbili kuruka kutoka kwenye gari lililoegeshwa au linalosonga na kuacha injini ikiwaka. Ikiwa unasonga kwa kasi ya kutosha, hili litakwamisha kichapuzi na kulipeleka gari mbele kwa kasi.", ["TRIANGLE"]], ["Tip: Double tap to leave the engine running on a boat and it will continue on its course, allowing you to move around the vessel freely.", "Kidokezo: Gusa [TRIANGLE] mara mbili kuacha injini ya boti ikiwaka nayo itaendelea na mwelekeo wake, ikikuwezesha kuzunguka chomboni kwa uhuru.", ["TRIANGLE"]], ["While in a vehicle, press to hit someone with your door.", "Ukiwa ndani ya gari, bonyeza [SQUARE] kumgonga mtu kwa mlango wako.", ["SQUARE"]], ["Tip: If you're riding a bike or a scooter, press to kick anything next to you.", "Kidokezo: Ukiendesha baiskeli au skuta, bonyeza [SQUARE] kupiga teke chochote kilicho kando yako.", ["SQUARE"]], ["Press while in a vehicle to give the middle finger.", "Bonyeza [R1] ukiwa ndani ya gari kuonyesha kidole cha kati.", ["R1"]], ["Press to yell at nearby pedestrians or drivers.", "Bonyeza [R3] kuwapigia kelele watembea kwa miguu au madereva walio karibu.", ["R3"]], ["Approach a vehicle from the front or the back and use to push it. Hold to shove it harder.", "Karibia gari kutoka mbele au nyuma na utumie [LEFT-STICK] kulisukuma. Shikilia [SQUARE] kulisukuma kwa nguvu zaidi.", ["LEFT-STICK", "SQUARE"]], ["This can be handy if your vehicle is out of fuel or otherwise immobilized.", "Hii inaweza kusaidia gari lako likiishiwa mafuta au likishindwa kusonga kwa sababu nyingine.", []], ["While flying a plane, hold to accelerate and to slow down. Use to roll left or right, or to adjust the pitch of the aircraft.", "Unaporusha ndege, shikilia [R2] kuongeza kasi na [L2] kupunguza kasi. Tumia [LEFT-STICK] kubingirisha kushoto au kulia, au kurekebisha mwinamo wa ndege.", ["R2", "L2", "LEFT-STICK"]], ["Hold or to adjust the yaw and make slight adjustments left and right.", "Shikilia [SQUARE] au [CIRCLE] kurekebisha mzunguko na kufanya marekebisho madogo kushoto na kulia.", ["SQUARE", "CIRCLE"]], ["Hold to select a weapon if the aircraft is armed.", "Shikilia [L1] kuchagua silaha ikiwa ndege ina silaha.", ["L1"]], ["Tip: Getting in an aircraft automatically equips you with a parachute in case you need to make an emergency exit.", "Kidokezo: Kuingia kwenye ndege kunakuvalisha parachuti kiotomatiki endapo utahitaji kutoka kwa dharura.", []], ["To land safely, hold to reduce your speed and use to reduce your altitude steadily.", "Ili kutua salama, shikilia [L2] kupunguza kasi yako na utumie [LEFT-STICK] kupunguza mwinuko wako taratibu.", ["L2", "LEFT-STICK"]], ["Press to deploy any landing gear if needed. When close to the ground, keep the nose up until you touch down.", "Bonyeza [L3] kushusha magurudumu ya kutua ikihitajika. Ukikaribia ardhi, weka pua juu hadi utakapogusa ardhi.", ["L3"]], ["Tip: For an easier landing, choose your angle of approach early and avoid last-minute course corrections.", "Kidokezo: Ili kutua kwa urahisi zaidi, chagua pembe yako ya kukaribia mapema na uepuke kubadilisha mwelekeo dakika za mwisho.", []], ["While flying a helicopter, hold to gain altitude or hold to descend.", "Unaporusha helikopta, shikilia [R2] kupanda juu au shikilia [L2] kushuka.", ["R2", "L2"]], ["Hold or to perform a turn left or right. When landing, choose a flat area clear of obstacles and descend gently.", "Shikilia [SQUARE] au [CIRCLE] kugeuka kushoto au kulia. Unapotua, chagua eneo tambarare lisilo na vikwazo na ushuke taratibu.", ["SQUARE", "CIRCLE"]], ["Tip: Helicopters will hover in midair if no controls are used.", "Kidokezo: Helikopta zitaelea angani ikiwa hakuna vidhibiti vinavyotumika.", []], ["A crime has been reported to the cops, and they're on their way to the scene.", "Uhalifu umeripotiwa kwa polisi, na wako njiani kuelekea eneo la tukio.", []], ["Tip: If you've committed a crime, this is your best chance to escape without incident. Flee the scene fast and you may avoid the cops entirely.", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa umefanya uhalifu, hii ndiyo nafasi yako bora ya kutoroka bila tatizo. Toroka eneo la tukio haraka na huenda ukawaepuka polisi kabisa.", []], ["An incident has been reported, but the cops don't yet know your identity and you're reported as an unknown suspect. They will struggle to link you to the crime if you keep a low profile.", "Tukio limeripotiwa, lakini polisi bado hawajui utambulisho wako na umeripotiwa kama mshukiwa asiyejulikana. Watapata ugumu kukuhusisha na uhalifu ukijiweka chini ya rada.", []], ["Tip: Leave the scene without drawing attention and you may avoid a pursuit.", "Kidokezo: Ondoka eneo la tukio bila kuvutia macho na huenda ukaepuka msako.", []], ["The cops are coming for you. They have visual on you and your identity is known.", "Polisi wanakuja kukukamata. Wanakuona na utambulisho wako unajulikana.", []], ["The more serious your offenses, the higher your wanted level and the harder the cops will come after you.", "Kadiri makosa yako yanavyokuwa mazito, ndivyo kiwango chako cha kusakwa kinavyopanda na ndivyo polisi watakavyokufuata kwa nguvu zaidi.", []], ["Tip: You're more likely to get away if you focus on slowing the cops down rather than shooting to kill. Shooting out cop car tires will slow their pursuit, and helicopters may retreat if shot at.", "Kidokezo: Una nafasi kubwa zaidi ya kutoroka ukilenga kuwachelewesha polisi badala ya kufyatua ili kuua. Kufyatua matairi ya magari ya polisi kutachelewesha msako wao, na helikopta zinaweza kurudi nyuma zikifyatuliwa.", []], ["The cops have lost visual, but they're still in pursuit and will keep looking for you.", "Polisi wamepoteza mwonekano wako, lakini bado wanakusaka na wataendelea kukutafuta.", []], ["If you leave the cops' search radius without getting spotted, your wanted stars will flash and you'll eventually lose the cops.", "Ukitoka kwenye eneo la utafutaji la polisi bila kuonekana, nyota zako za kusakwa zitamweka na hatimaye utawapoteza polisi.", []], ["Tip: Stay hidden for long enough and they'll lose you completely, but you may still have heat in the area.", "Kidokezo: Endelea kujificha kwa muda wa kutosha na watakupoteza kabisa, lakini bado unaweza kuwa na joto katika eneo hilo.", []], ["After losing the cops, you'll still have heat in the area around your last known location, marked on the map.", "Baada ya kuwapoteza polisi, bado utakuwa na joto katika eneo linalozunguka mahali ulipoonekana mara ya mwisho, lililowekewa alama kwenye ramani.", []], ["If you're spotted or commit another crime in that area, you'll regain your wanted level.", "Ukionekana au kufanya uhalifu mwingine katika eneo hilo, kiwango chako cha kusakwa kitarejea.", []], ["Leave the area or find a good spot to lie low and avoid being seen.", "Ondoka eneo hilo au tafuta mahali pazuri pa kujificha na uepuke kuonekana.", []], ["Tip: Change your appearance or vehicle to help reduce your chance of being recognized.", "Kidokezo: Badilisha mwonekano wako au gari lako ili kupunguza uwezekano wa kutambuliwa.", []], ["The cops don't have a visual description of you, your partner, or your vehicle.", "Polisi hawana maelezo ya mwonekano wako, wa mshirika wako, au wa gari lako.", []], ["They will have little to immediately spot you as a suspect, but will still be on the lookout in the area with heat.", "Watakuwa na machache ya kukutambua mara moja kama mshukiwa, lakini bado watakuwa macho katika eneo lenye joto.", []], ["Tip: Keep a low profile. Commit a new crime in the area and you run the risk of being recognized and regaining your wanted level.", "Kidokezo: Jiweke chini ya rada. Ukifanya uhalifu mpya katika eneo hilo unajiweka hatarini kutambuliwa na kiwango chako cha kusakwa kurejea.", []], ["These icons indicate information the cops can use to identify you after a crime.", "Aikoni hizi zinaonyesha taarifa ambazo polisi wanaweza kutumia kukutambua baada ya uhalifu.", []], ["Appearance recognized", "[ICON1] Mwonekano umetambuliwa", ["ICON"]], ["Vehicle recognized", "[ICON1] Gari limetambuliwa", ["ICON"]], ["Outfit recognized", "[ICON1] Mavazi yametambuliwa", ["ICON"]], ["Visible weapon", "[ICON1] Silaha inayoonekana", ["ICON"]], ["Partner recognized", "[ICON1] Mshirika ametambuliwa", ["ICON"]], ["Recorded by CCTV", "[ICON1] Umerekodiwa na CCTV", ["ICON"]], ["Recorded by cloud CCTV", "[ICON1] Umerekodiwa na CCTV ya wingu", ["ICON"]], ["Removing these recognition icons makes it much easier to escape an area that has heat.", "Kuondoa aikoni hizi za utambulikaji kunafanya iwe rahisi zaidi kutoroka eneo lenye joto.", []], ["Tip: Other factors can affect recognition, like bloodstains or exploded dye packs.", "Kidokezo: Mambo mengine yanaweza kuathiri utambulikaji, kama madoa ya damu au mifuko ya rangi iliyolipuka.", []], ["If the cops can recognize your vehicle, try getting a quick respray or find a new ride.", "Ikiwa polisi wanaweza kutambua gari lako, jaribu kulipaka rangi upya haraka au tafuta usafiri mpya.", []], ["Tip: Pay 'n' Sprays may not service some vehicles depending on the tracker installed.", "Kidokezo: Pay 'n' Spray [ICON1] huenda zisihudumie baadhi ya magari kulingana na kifuatiliaji kilichowekwa.", ["ICON"]], ["Change your clothes if the cops can recognize your outfit.", "Badilisha nguo zako ikiwa polisi wanaweza kutambua mavazi yako.", []], ["It's a good idea to travel with a spare set of clothes in the trunk of your personal vehicle just in case.", "Ni wazo zuri kusafiri na nguo za akiba kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] endapo tu.", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: You can steal clothing from some stores while wanted to quickly change your outfit.", "Kidokezo: Unaweza kuiba nguo kutoka kwenye baadhi ya maduka ukiwa unasakwa ili kubadilisha mavazi yako haraka.", []], ["Openly carrying a weapon can draw more attention from cops or civilians. You can quickly holster it by pressing", "Kubeba silaha waziwazi kunaweza kuvutia zaidi macho ya polisi au raia. Unaweza kuirudisha haraka kwa kubonyeza [L1]", ["L1"]], ["Tip: Sidearms can be concealed, but longarms can't. Drop them or stow them in a vehicle's trunk to hide them from the cops.", "Kidokezo: Bastola zinaweza kufichwa, lakini bunduki ndefu haziwezi. Ziangushe au uziweke kwenye buti la gari ili kuzificha dhidi ya polisi.", []], ["Some businesses use CCTV to protect their premises. If you're recorded committing a crime, the cops can use this footage to identify you once they arrive.", "Baadhi ya biashara hutumia CCTV [ICON1] kulinda majengo yao. Ukirekodiwa ukifanya uhalifu, polisi wanaweza kutumia rekodi hizi kukutambua watakapofika.", ["ICON"]], ["Regular CCTV recordings are stored on site and can be destroyed.", "Rekodi za kawaida za CCTV huhifadhiwa papo hapo na zinaweza kuharibiwa.", []], ["Tip: If the CCTV footage is stored on the cloud you won't be able to destroy it, and an alarm will eventually go off.", "Kidokezo: Ikiwa rekodi za CCTV zimehifadhiwa kwenye wingu [ICON1] hutaweza kuziharibu, na hatimaye kengele italia.", ["ICON"]], ["Hiding from the cops can be your best bet. Your player arrow will change color if you're hidden or if the cops know your location", "Kujificha dhidi ya polisi kunaweza kuwa chaguo lako bora. Mshale wako wa mchezaji utabadilika rangi ukiwa umejificha [ICON1] au polisi wakijua mahali ulipo [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Use your environment. Climb ladders and slip through unlocked doors. In rural areas, look for woodland and bushes. When in a stationary vehicle, hold to duck down and hide.", "Tumia mazingira yako. Panda ngazi na upenye kupitia milango isiyofungwa. Vijijini, tafuta misitu na vichaka. Ukiwa ndani ya gari lililosimama, shikilia [CIRCLE] kuinama na kujificha.", ["CIRCLE"]], ["Tip: K9 units will track you relentlessly. If they're called in, keep moving or they'll hunt you down.", "Kidokezo: Vikosi vya mbwa wa polisi vitakufuatilia bila kuchoka. Wakiitwa, endelea kusonga la sivyo watakuwinda.", []], ["When the cops are in pursuit, keep moving and escape their wanted radius to increase your chances of losing them.", "Polisi wanapokusaka, endelea kusonga na utoroke eneo lao la kusaka ili kuongeza nafasi zako za kuwapoteza.", []], ["Fleeing on foot by vaulting and climbing can sometimes give you more ways to evade the police. If a vehicle is in your way, press at the right moment to slide over the hood and keep momentum. Some door and gate controls can be triggered by gunfire, opening the way ahead.", "Kukimbia kwa miguu kwa kuruka na kupanda vikwazo wakati mwingine kunaweza kukupa njia zaidi za kuwakwepa polisi. Gari likiwa njiani mwako, bonyeza [X] kwa wakati sahihi kuteleza juu ya boneti na kudumisha kasi. Baadhi ya vidhibiti vya milango na mageti vinaweza kuamshwa kwa risasi, na kufungua njia mbele.", ["X"]], ["Tip: It's easier to evade the cops if you can break their line of sight.", "Kidokezo: Ni rahisi zaidi kuwakwepa polisi ukiweza kukata mstari wao wa kuona.", []], ["Killing cops will provoke a more aggressive police response. Aim at non-lethal areas or body armor to incapacitate them without raising the stakes.", "Kuua polisi kutasababisha mwitikio mkali zaidi wa polisi. Lenga maeneo yasiyoua au kinga ya mwili ili kuwalemaza bila kuongeza hatari.", []], ["You can also hold off the cops with suppressing fire, slowing their approach without hitting them.", "Unaweza pia kuwazuia polisi kwa risasi za kuwabana, ukichelewesha ujio wao bila kuwapiga.", []], ["Tip: Fire your sidearm while driving by pressing", "Kidokezo: Fyatua bastola yako unapoendesha kwa kubonyeza [R1]", ["R1"]], ["If you're wasted or busted by the cops, you'll lose your pocket cash plus a small BuckMe maintenance fee You'll also lose any unowned weapons, and stash bags you were carrying will most likely be lost.", "Ukiuawa au ukikamatwa na polisi, utapoteza pesa zako taslimu mfukoni [ICON1] pamoja na ada ndogo ya matengenezo ya BuckMe [ICON2] Pia utapoteza silaha zozote usizomiliki, na mifuko ya kuhifadhi uliyokuwa umebeba huenda itapotea.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Recover owned weapons from the trunk of your personal vehicle or from an Ammu-Nation weapon locker", "Rejesha silaha unazomiliki kutoka kwenye buti la gari lako binafsi [ICON1] au kutoka kwenye kabati la silaha la Ammu-Nation [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["To lessen the risk of losing cash, deposit it at an ATM", "Ili kupunguza hatari ya kupoteza pesa taslimu, ziweke kwenye ATM [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["If your facial appearance can be recognized by the cops, put on or take off accessories from your loadout to change your look.", "Ikiwa sura yako inaweza kutambuliwa na polisi, vaa au vua mapambo kutoka kwenye mzigo wako [L1] ili kubadilisha mwonekano wako.", ["L1"]], ["You can also change hairstyles to adjust your appearance by visiting a salon or barber", "Unaweza pia kubadilisha mtindo wa nywele ili kurekebisha mwonekano wako kwa kutembelea saluni au kinyozi [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Tip: Put on a mask to cover your face before committing a crime and remove it when you're out of sight.", "Kidokezo: Vaa barakoa kufunika uso wako kabla ya kufanya uhalifu na uivue ukiwa mbali na macho ya watu.", []], ["The sensitivity of the horizontal camera speed when using to look around.", "Usikivu wa kasi ya kamera ya mlalo unapotumia [ICON1] kutazama pande zote.", ["ICON"]], ["The sensitivity of the horizontal camera speed when using while aiming.", "Usikivu wa kasi ya kamera ya mlalo unapotumia [ICON1] ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["How quickly your camera reaches the highest speed when using while looking around.", "Jinsi kamera yako inavyofikia kasi ya juu zaidi haraka unapotumia [ICON1] ukitazama pande zote.", ["ICON"]], ["The way responds while aiming.", "Jinsi [ICON1] inavyoitikia ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["Standard: Aim responsiveness is balanced between speed and precision.", "Kawaida: Mwitikio wa kulenga umesawazishwa kati ya kasi na usahihi.", []], ["Linear: Aim responsiveness matches raw input with how much is pushed.", "Mstari Ulionyooka: Mwitikio wa kulenga unalingana moja kwa moja na kiasi [ICON1] kinavyosukumwa.", ["ICON"]], ["Precision: Aim responsiveness is slower when partially pushing and will increase quickly when fully pushed.", "Usahihi: Mwitikio wa kulenga ni wa polepole unaposukuma [ICON1] kwa sehemu na utaongezeka haraka ukisukumwa kikamilifu.", ["ICON"]], ["Aggressive: Aim responsiveness is always fast when using and has less precision when partially pushed.", "Kali: Mwitikio wa kulenga daima ni wa haraka unapotumia [ICON1] na una usahihi mdogo ukisukumwa kwa sehemu.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose the direction of the camera when using to look around.", "Chagua mwelekeo wa kamera unapotumia [ICON1] kutazama pande zote.", ["ICON"]], ["Default: Push up to look up, and down to look down.", "Chaguo-msingi: Sukuma juu kutazama juu, na chini kutazama chini.", []], ["Push left to look left, and right to look right.", "Sukuma kushoto kutazama kushoto, na kulia kutazama kulia.", []], ["Vertical: Push up to look down, and down to look up.", "Wima: Sukuma juu kutazama chini, na chini kutazama juu.", []], ["Horizontal: Push left to look right, and right to look left.", "Mlalo: Sukuma kushoto kutazama kulia, na kulia kutazama kushoto.", []], ["Both: Push up to look down, and down to look up. Push left to look right, and right to look left.", "Zote Mbili: Sukuma juu kutazama chini, na chini kutazama juu. Sukuma kushoto kutazama kulia, na kulia kutazama kushoto.", []], ["Choose the movement direction when using on foot and in a vehicle.", "Chagua mwelekeo wa mwendo unapotumia [ICON1] kwa miguu na ndani ya gari.", ["ICON"]], ["Default: Push up to move forwards, and down to move backwards. Push left to move left, and right to move right.", "Chaguo-msingi: Sukuma juu kusonga mbele, na chini kurudi nyuma. Sukuma kushoto kusonga kushoto, na kulia kusonga kulia.", []], ["Vertical: Push up to move backwards, and down to move forwards.", "Wima: Sukuma juu kurudi nyuma, na chini kusonga mbele.", []], ["Horizontal: Push left to move right, and right to move left.", "Mlalo: Sukuma kushoto kusonga kulia, na kulia kusonga kushoto.", []], ["Both: Push up to move backwards, and down to move forwards. Push left to move right, and right to move left.", "Zote Mbili: Sukuma juu kurudi nyuma, na chini kusonga mbele. Sukuma kushoto kusonga kulia, na kulia kusonga kushoto.", []], ["Choose the direction of the camera when using to rotate the 3D map.", "Chagua mwelekeo wa kamera unapotumia [ICON1] kuzungusha ramani ya 3D.", ["ICON"]], ["Push left to rotate left, and right to rotate right.", "Sukuma kushoto kuzungusha kushoto, na kulia kuzungusha kulia.", []], ["Horizontal: Push left to rotate right, and right to rotate left.", "Mlalo: Sukuma kushoto kuzungusha kulia, na kulia kuzungusha kushoto.", []], ["Both: Push up to look down, and push down to look up.", "Zote Mbili: Sukuma juu kutazama chini, na sukuma chini kutazama juu.", []], ["Push left to rotate right, and right to rotate left.", "Sukuma kushoto kuzungusha kulia, na kulia kuzungusha kushoto.", []], ["Inverts the vertical movement of when controlling an aircraft.", "Hugeuza mwendo wima wa [ICON1] unapodhibiti ndege.", ["ICON"]], ["The strength of vibration from your controller.", "Nguvu ya mtetemo kutoka kwenye kidhibiti chako.", []], ["How far you have to move to register movement. A higher deadzone means you'll have to push further.", "Umbali unaopaswa kusogeza [ICON1] ili mwendo utambuliwe. Eneo lisilotambua kubwa zaidi linamaanisha utalazimika kusukuma zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["This can help with controllers experiencing stick drift to not register smaller movements.", "Hii inaweza kusaidia vidhibiti vyenye tatizo la vijiti kujisogeza vyenyewe ili visitambue mienendo midogo.", []], ["Lowering this value can result in unexpected movement from the stick.", "Kupunguza thamani hii kunaweza kusababisha mwendo usiotarajiwa kutoka kwenye kijiti.", []], ["Applies simulated resistance to and on your DualSense® wireless controller for actions that use the adaptive triggers, such as shooting and driving.", "Huweka ukinzani bandia kwa [ICON1] na [ICON2] kwenye kidhibiti chako kisichotumia waya cha DualSense® kwa vitendo vinavyotumia vitufe vinavyojirekebisha, kama kupiga risasi na kuendesha.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Maintains the vehicle at a reasonable speed for the road you're on when you hold to the resistance point.", "Hudumisha gari kwenye kasi inayofaa kwa barabara uliyopo unaposhikilia [ICON1] hadi kwenye kiwango cha ukinzani.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose whether to open the map or toggle the camera view when pressing .", "Chagua kama kufungua ramani au kubadilisha mwonekano wa kamera unapobonyeza [ICON1].", ["ICON"]], ["Activates the light bar on your DualSense® wireless controller in various situations, such as when you're wanted.", "Huwasha upau wa mwanga kwenye kidhibiti chako kisichotumia waya cha DualSense® katika hali mbalimbali, kama unaposakwa.", []], ["Choose your preference for aiming lock-on.", "Chagua mapendeleo yako ya kufunga lengo unapolenga.", []], ["Lock-On: Aiming will always attempt to lock on to the nearest target.", "Kufunga Lengo: Ulengaji utajaribu daima kufunga kwenye lengo lililo karibu zaidi.", []], ["Partial: Aiming will move towards a nearby target but will not lock on.", "Kiasi: Ulengaji utasogea kuelekea lengo lililo karibu lakini hautafunga.", []], ["Free Aim: Aiming will never lock on to a target.", "Kulenga Huru: Ulengaji hautawahi kufunga kwenye lengo.", []], ["Slows down the movement of the reticle while aiming at a target.", "Hupunguza kasi ya mwendo wa kilengeo unapolenga shabaha.", []], ["Keeps your aim locked on to a target before reverting to free aim.", "Huweka ulengaji wako umefungwa kwenye lengo kabla ya kurudi kwenye kulenga huru.", []], ["A longer lock-on time makes it easier to track moving targets.", "Muda mrefu zaidi wa kufunga lengo unafanya iwe rahisi kufuatilia malengo yanayosonga.", []], ["While locked on, allows to switch to other targets nearby.", "Ukiwa umefunga lengo, huruhusu [ICON1] kubadili kwenda malengo mengine yaliyo karibu.", ["ICON"]], ["Assists with tracking targets that are within close proximity.", "Husaidia kufuatilia malengo yaliyo karibu sana.", []], ["While driving, firing a weapon auto-aims to nearby targets.", "Unapoendesha, kufyatua silaha hulenga kiotomatiki malengo yaliyo karibu.", []], ["Draws your last equipped weapon when using and pressing . If carrying two longarms, your off-hand weapon will be drawn instead.", "Huchomoa silaha yako ya mwisho uliyoshika unapotumia [ICON1] na kubonyeza [ICON2]. Ukibeba bunduki ndefu mbili, silaha ya mkono wako mwingine itachomolewa badala yake.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Choose whether the camera orientation is considered when finding a position to take cover.", "Chagua kama mwelekeo wa kamera unazingatiwa wakati wa kutafuta mahali pa kujificha nyuma ya kizuizi.", []], ["Choose to automatically or manually holster drawn weapons after a short time while in a vehicle and not in combat.", "Chagua kurudisha silaha zilizochomolewa kiotomatiki au kwa mkono baada ya muda mfupi ukiwa ndani ya gari na usipokuwa vitani.", []], ["The max movement speed when using .", "Kasi ya juu ya mwendo unapotumia [ICON1].", ["ICON"]], ["Walk: Your max speed will be a walk when is fully pushed.", "Tembea: Kasi yako ya juu itakuwa kutembea [ICON1] ikisukumwa kikamilifu.", ["ICON"]], ["Fast Walk: Your max speed will be a fast walk when is fully pushed. Ease off the stick to move at slower speeds.", "Tembea Haraka: Kasi yako ya juu itakuwa kutembea haraka [ICON1] ikisukumwa kikamilifu. Legeza kijiti ili kusonga kwa kasi ndogo zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["Jog: Your max speed will be a brisk jog when is fully pushed. Ease off the stick to move at slower speeds.", "Kukimbia Taratibu: Kasi yako ya juu itakuwa kukimbia kwa wepesi [ICON1] ikisukumwa kikamilifu. Legeza kijiti ili kusonga kwa kasi ndogo zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["The movement speed when using during combat.", "Kasi ya mwendo unapotumia [ICON1] wakati wa mapambano.", ["ICON"]], ["Your default movement speed will override this setting if it's faster.", "Kasi yako ya mwendo ya chaguo-msingi itabatilisha mpangilio huu ikiwa ni ya haraka zaidi.", []], ["Stands you up automatically when activating sprint instead of staying in a crouch.", "Hukusimamisha kiotomatiki unapowasha kukimbia kasi badala ya kubaki umeinama.", []], ["Choose how to complete actions requiring repeated presses.", "Chagua jinsi ya kukamilisha vitendo vinavyohitaji kubonyeza mara kwa mara.", []], ["A single press can register as 2, 3, or 4 presses, or can be swapped to a hold.", "Mbonyezo mmoja unaweza kuhesabiwa kama mibonyezo 2, 3 au 4, au unaweza kubadilishwa kuwa kushikilia.", []], ["Delays holds to avoid accidental presses.", "Huchelewesha kushikilia ili kuepuka mibonyezo ya bahati mbaya.", []], ["Choose how to complete actions requiring holds.", "Chagua jinsi ya kukamilisha vitendo vinavyohitaji kushikilia.", []], ["A hold will register as a full hold when the button is pressed for 2x, 3x, or 4x less time than the default.", "Kushikilia kutahesabiwa kama kushikilia kamili kitufe kikibonyezwa kwa muda mfupi mara 2, 3 au 4 kuliko chaguo-msingi.", []], ["Assign the input for using focus and combat focus.", "Weka kitufe cha kutumia umakini na umakini vitani.", []], ["Warning: Using may make other actions on the same input unavailable.", "Onyo: Kutumia [ICON1] kunaweza kufanya vitendo vingine kwenye kitufe hicho hicho visipatikane.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose how to perform directional button hold actions, such as using quick navigation or the radio .", "Chagua jinsi ya kufanya vitendo vya kushikilia vitufe vya mwelekeo, kama kutumia uelekezaji wa haraka [ICON1] au redio [ICON2].", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Choose whether you hold or press to aim.", "Chagua kama unashikilia au kubonyeza [ICON1] kulenga.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose whether you hold or press when interacting with people and items.", "Chagua kama unashikilia au kubonyeza [ICON1] unapowasiliana na watu na kutumia vitu.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose how to access your loadout.", "Chagua jinsi ya kufikia mzigo wako.", []], ["Hold & Release: Hold and release to open your loadout and press again to close it.", "Shikilia na Uachilie: Shikilia na uachilie [ICON1] kufungua mzigo wako na ubonyeze [ICON2] tena kuufunga.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Choose the reeling controls when fishing.", "Chagua vidhibiti vya kuvuta uzi unapovua samaki.", []], ["Rotate: Rotate to reel in a fish.", "Zungusha: Zungusha [ICON1] kumvuta samaki.", ["ICON"]], ["Hold: Hold or repeatedly tap to reel in a fish.", "Shikilia: Shikilia au gusa [ICON1] mara kwa mara kumvuta samaki.", ["ICON"]], ["Pull: Pull to reel in a fish.", "Vuta: Vuta [ICON1] kumvuta samaki.", ["ICON"]], ["Choose whether you hold or press when using the vehicle nitrous.", "Chagua kama unashikilia au kubonyeza [ICON1] unapotumia nitro ya gari.", ["ICON"]], ["Simplifies the interactions needed for situations such as exercising, hotwiring, and basketball.", "Hurahisisha vitendo vinavyohitajika katika hali kama kufanya mazoezi, kuwasha gari bila ufunguo, na mpira wa kikapu.", []], ["Drives you automatically to your set destination. Auto Drive can only be enabled when in cinematic camera.", "Hukuendesha kiotomatiki hadi kifikio ulichoweka. Kuendesha Kiotomatiki kunaweza kuwashwa tu ukiwa kwenye kamera ya kisinema.", []], ["Restricted: Only available in safe scenarios.", "Yenye Vizuizi: Inapatikana tu katika hali salama.", []], ["Unrestricted: Available in all scenarios, including situations that are less safe or may lead to collisions.", "Bila Vizuizi: Inapatikana katika hali zote, pamoja na hali zisizo salama sana au zinazoweza kusababisha migongano.", []], ["Automatically equips your helmet when getting on certain vehicles, such as motorcycles and bikes. The helmet will be unequipped when you get off.", "Hukuvalisha kofia ngumu kiotomatiki unapopanda baadhi ya vyombo, kama pikipiki na baiskeli. Kofia itavuliwa unaposhuka.", []], ["Reduces enemy health and damage taken by your character.", "Hupunguza afya ya maadui na uharibifu anaopata mhusika wako.", []], ["Warning: This will significantly change the balance and experience of gameplay.", "Onyo: Hili litabadilisha kwa kiasi kikubwa uwiano na uzoefu wa uchezaji.", []], ["Reduces damage taken by your vehicle.", "Hupunguza uharibifu unaopata gari lako.", []], ["Adjust the brightness of your game.", "Rekebisha mwangaza wa mchezo wako.", []], ["Adjust the safe zone to fit your screen.", "Rekebisha eneo salama ili kutoshea skrini yako.", []], ["The intensity of screen effects for your character status, such as being low on health or stamina.", "Ukali wa athari za skrini kwa hali ya mhusika wako, kama afya au stamina ikiwa chini.", []], ["The intensity of screen edge hit effects, such as blood spatters, bullet whizz by, and armor hits.", "Ukali wa athari za kupigwa pembeni mwa skrini, kama michirizi ya damu, risasi zinazopita karibu, na kinga kupigwa.", []], ["The intensity of screen edge effects that warn of cops and off-screen threats.", "Ukali wa athari za pembeni mwa skrini zinazoonya kuhusu polisi na hatari zilizo nje ya skrini.", []], ["The intensity of motion blur effects when moving your character or the camera quickly.", "Ukali wa athari za ukungu wa mwendo unaposogeza mhusika wako au kamera kwa haraka.", []], ["Shows dismemberment for certain types of damage and injuries.", "Huonyesha kukatwa viungo kwa aina fulani za uharibifu na majeraha.", []], ["The intensity of blood and gore for damage and injuries.", "Ukali wa damu na majeraha kwa uharibifu na majeraha.", []], ["Choose whether flashbangs display a bright or a dark flash.", "Chagua kama mabomu ya mwanga yanaonyesha mmweko angavu au wa giza.", []], ["Applies boosted colors on trails to assist with visibility and colorblindness.", "Huweka rangi zilizoimarishwa kwenye mikondo ili kusaidia uonekanaji na upofu wa rangi.", []], ["Applies a filter to the world that softens the output of bright lights without impacting the HUD.", "Huweka kichujio ulimwenguni kinachopunguza ukali wa taa angavu bila kuathiri HUD.", []], ["Warning: This will affect how the game and scenes are presented.", "Onyo: Hili litaathiri jinsi mchezo na matukio yanavyoonyeshwa.", []], ["Applies a high contrast color to entities and interactions in world.", "Huweka rangi ya utofauti mkubwa kwa vitu na mwingiliano ulimwenguni.", []], ["The language of the UI.", "Lugha ya kiolesura.", []], ["The size of text, icons, and button prompts.", "Ukubwa wa maandishi, aikoni na vidokezo vya vitufe.", []], ["Small will affect some of the HUD but not menus.", "Ndogo itaathiri sehemu ya HUD lakini si menyu.", []], ["The colors across the UI and HUD.", "Rangi katika kiolesura na HUD.", []], ["Player", "Mchezaji", []], ["Companion", "Mwandamani", []], ["Enemy", "Adui", []], ["Personal", "Binafsi", []], ["Main Missions", "Misheni Kuu", []], ["Side Missions", "Misheni za Pembeni", []], ["The size of blips on the map.", "Ukubwa wa alama kwenye ramani.", []], ["The size of in-world markers and blips on the compass.", "Ukubwa wa alama ulimwenguni na alama kwenye dira.", []], ["Choose when to display subtitles.", "Chagua wakati wa kuonyesha manukuu.", []], ["Off: Subtitles will never display.", "Imezimwa: Manukuu hayataonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["Mission Only: Subtitles will only display during moments critical to gameplay and story.", "Misheni Pekee: Manukuu yataonyeshwa tu wakati wa matukio muhimu kwa uchezaji na hadithi.", []], ["This is a subtitle.", "Haya ni manukuu.", []], ["On: Subtitles will always display.", "Imewashwa: Manukuu yataonyeshwa daima.", []], ["Choose when to display closed captions.", "Chagua wakati wa kuonyesha maelezo ya sauti.", []], ["On: Displays text detailing non-speech and environmental sounds.", "Imewashwa: Huonyesha maandishi yanayoelezea sauti zisizo za usemi na sauti za mazingira.", []], ["Off: Closed captions will never display.", "Imezimwa: Maelezo ya sauti hayataonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["Non-Speech: Displays text detailing non-speech sounds only.", "Yasiyo ya Usemi: Huonyesha maandishi yanayoelezea sauti zisizo za usemi pekee.", []], ["Environment: Displays text detailing environmental sounds only.", "Mazingira: Huonyesha maandishi yanayoelezea sauti za mazingira pekee.", []], ["The size of the subtitles and closed captions.", "Ukubwa wa manukuu na maelezo ya sauti.", []], ["Displays the name of the character in subtitles and closed captions.", "Huonyesha jina la mhusika katika manukuu na maelezo ya sauti.", []], ["Choose the background for subtitles and closed captions.", "Chagua mandharinyuma ya manukuu na maelezo ya sauti.", []], ["Off: No background.", "Imezimwa: Hakuna mandharinyuma.", []], ["Transparent: Displays a partially transparent background.", "Uwazi: Huonyesha mandharinyuma yenye uwazi kiasi.", []], ["Solid: Displays an opaque background.", "Imara: Huonyesha mandharinyuma yasiyopenyeza mwanga.", []], ["Choose when the minimap displays on the HUD.", "Chagua wakati ramani ndogo inaonyeshwa kwenye HUD.", []], ["Dynamic: Minimap will display dynamically for gameplay purposes or when pressing", "Inayobadilika: Ramani ndogo itaonyeshwa kulingana na mahitaji ya uchezaji au unapobonyeza [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Off: Minimap will never display.", "Imezimwa: Ramani ndogo haitaonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["On: Minimap will always display, except during cinematic moments and cutscenes.", "Imewashwa: Ramani ndogo itaonyeshwa daima, isipokuwa wakati wa matukio ya kisinema na vipande vya filamu.", []], ["The size of the minimap on the HUD.", "Ukubwa wa ramani ndogo kwenye HUD.", []], ["Choose when the compass displays on the HUD.", "Chagua wakati dira inaonyeshwa kwenye HUD.", []], ["The compass can be used to support the minimap or as an alternate method of navigation.", "Dira inaweza kutumika kusaidia ramani ndogo au kama njia mbadala ya uelekezaji.", []], ["Dynamic: Compass will display when driving, wanted, or when pressing", "Inayobadilika: Dira itaonyeshwa unapoendesha, unaposakwa, au unapobonyeza [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Off: Compass will never display.", "Imezimwa: Dira haitaonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["When in a vehicle, displays GPS route to your set destination.", "Ukiwa ndani ya gari, huonyesha njia ya GPS hadi kifikio ulichoweka.", []], ["Choose when to display upcoming directions on the HUD when in a vehicle.", "Chagua wakati wa kuonyesha maelekezo yanayokuja kwenye HUD ukiwa ndani ya gari.", []], ["On: Turn indicators will display on all roads.", "Imewashwa: Viashiria vya kona vitaonyeshwa kwenye barabara zote.", []], ["Highways: Turn indicators will only display on highways.", "Barabara Kuu: Viashiria vya kona vitaonyeshwa kwenye barabara kuu pekee.", []], ["Off: Turn indicators will never display.", "Imezimwa: Viashiria vya kona havitaonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["Choose when to display nearby in-world markers. They can also be recalled by holding", "Chagua wakati wa kuonyesha alama za ulimwenguni zilizo karibu. Zinaweza pia kuitwa tena kwa kushikilia [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["On: Nearby in-world markers will always appear.", "Imewashwa: Alama za ulimwenguni zilizo karibu zitaonekana daima.", []], ["Off: Nearby in-world markers will never appear.", "Imezimwa: Alama za ulimwenguni zilizo karibu hazitaonekana kamwe.", []], ["Objectives: Nearby in-world markers will only appear for mission objectives and manually set destinations.", "Malengo: Alama za ulimwenguni zilizo karibu zitaonekana tu kwa malengo ya misheni na vifikio ulivyoweka mwenyewe.", []], ["Displays a marker on any interior or exterior door that can be opened.", "Huonyesha alama kwenye mlango wowote wa ndani au wa nje unaoweza kufunguliwa.", []], ["On: Door markers will always appear on approach.", "Imewashwa: Alama za milango zitaonekana daima unapokaribia.", []], ["Dynamic: Door markers will always appear, but at a reduced distance.", "Inayobadilika: Alama za milango zitaonekana daima, lakini kwa umbali mfupi zaidi.", []], ["Off: Door markers will never appear.", "Imezimwa: Alama za milango hazitaonekana kamwe.", []], ["Displays a marker in proximity to certain things that can be interacted with.", "Huonyesha alama karibu na baadhi ya vitu vinavyoweza kutumiwa.", []], ["Displays the altimeter when flying an aircraft.", "Huonyesha kipimo cha mwinuko unaporusha ndege.", []], ["Shows a persistent dot in the center of the screen that may aid with motion sickness.", "Huonyesha nukta ya kudumu katikati ya skrini ambayo inaweza kusaidia dhidi ya kizunguzungu cha mwendo.", []], ["Shows hit markers around the reticle when damaging targets.", "Huonyesha alama za kugonga kuzunguka kilengeo unapoharibu malengo.", []], ["The size of the weapon reticle displayed on screen.", "Ukubwa wa kilengeo cha silaha kinachoonyeshwa kwenye skrini.", []], ["How the weapon reticle is displayed on screen.", "Jinsi kilengeo cha silaha kinavyoonyeshwa kwenye skrini.", []], ["Complex: The reticle is unique between different weapon types.", "Changamano: Kilengeo ni cha kipekee kwa kila aina ya silaha.", []], ["Simple: A dot with a ring that varies with accuracy.", "Rahisi: Nukta yenye pete inayobadilika kulingana na usahihi.", []], ["Dot: A dot only.", "Nukta: Nukta pekee.", []], ["None: No reticle.", "Hakuna: Hakuna kilengeo.", []], ["The visibility of the reticle when a weapon is equipped and not aiming.", "Mwonekano wa kilengeo silaha ikiwa mkononi bila kulenga.", []], ["The visibility of the reticle when aiming.", "Mwonekano wa kilengeo unapolenga.", []], ["Displays score updates near the reticle during activities, such as at shooting ranges.", "Huonyesha masasisho ya alama karibu na kilengeo wakati wa shughuli, kama kwenye viwanja vya kulenga shabaha.", []], ["Displays an arc when you aim a throwable item.", "Huonyesha mkunjo unapolenga kitu cha kurusha.", []], ["Off (Toggle On): Arc doesn't display by default. It can be toggled on with while aiming.", "Imezimwa (Washa kwa Kubadili): Mkunjo hauonyeshwi kwa chaguo-msingi. Unaweza kuwashwa kwa [ICON1] ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["On (Toggle Off): Arc displays by default. It can be toggled off with while aiming.", "Imewashwa (Zima kwa Kubadili): Mkunjo huonyeshwa kwa chaguo-msingi. Unaweza kuzimwa kwa [ICON1] ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["Always On: Arc will always display.", "Huwashwa Daima: Mkunjo utaonyeshwa daima.", []], ["Always Off: Arc will never display.", "Huzimwa Daima: Mkunjo hautaonyeshwa kamwe.", []], ["Displays your equipped weapon on the HUD.", "Huonyesha silaha uliyoshika kwenye HUD.", []], ["Displays ammo for your equipped weapon on the HUD.", "Huonyesha risasi za silaha uliyoshika kwenye HUD.", []], ["Displays visual effects to highlight vulnerable areas on targets when using combat focus.", "Huonyesha athari za kuona kuangazia maeneo dhaifu kwenye malengo unapotumia umakini vitani.", []], ["Displays feedback and confirmations on the HUD for interactions, such as for pick-ups and purchases.", "Huonyesha mrejesho na uthibitisho kwenye HUD kwa mwingiliano, kama kwa vitu unavyookota na manunuzi.", []], ["Displays updates on the HUD for any changes to Jason and Lucia's criminal profiles.", "Huonyesha masasisho kwenye HUD kwa mabadiliko yoyote ya wasifu wa kihalifu wa Jason na Lucia.", []], ["Displays updates on the HUD for any changes to Jason and Lucia's relationship.", "Huonyesha masasisho kwenye HUD kwa mabadiliko yoyote ya uhusiano wa Jason na Lucia.", []], ["Displays onboarding and relevant information on the HUD. Help text can be viewed in the Brief.", "Huonyesha maelekezo ya mwanzo na taarifa muhimu kwenye HUD. Maandishi ya msaada yanaweza kutazamwa katika Muhtasari.", []], ["Warning: Turning this off may make parts of the game more difficult to play.", "Onyo: Kuzima hiki kunaweza kufanya baadhi ya sehemu za mchezo kuwa ngumu zaidi kucheza.", []], ["Displays help and suggestions after failing, being busted, or wanted.", "Huonyesha msaada na mapendekezo baada ya kushindwa, kukamatwa, au kusakwa.", []], ["Displays your current objective on the HUD. Can be recalled by pressing", "Huonyesha lengo lako la sasa kwenye HUD. Linaweza kuitwa tena kwa kubonyeza [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Displays the mission name when you start a new task and a confirmation check when it's completed.", "Huonyesha jina la misheni unapoanza kazi mpya na alama ya uthibitisho inapokamilika.", []], ["Displays incoming and outgoing calls, texts, and app notifications on the HUD.", "Huonyesha simu zinazoingia na kutoka, ujumbe na arifa za programu kwenye HUD.", []], ["Displays a stylized area name on the HUD when you first discover it.", "Huonyesha jina la eneo kwa mtindo maalum kwenye HUD unapoligundua kwa mara ya kwanza.", []], ["Displays the area name on the HUD when you cross an area boundary.", "Huonyesha jina la eneo kwenye HUD unapovuka mpaka wa eneo.", []], ["Displays the street name on the HUD when you enter a different street.", "Huonyesha jina la mtaa kwenye HUD unapoingia mtaa tofauti.", []], ["Displays notifications that track updates in the Progress menu, such as for collectibles and challenges, and for newly discovered map locations and tasks.", "Huonyesha arifa zinazofuatilia masasisho katika menyu ya Maendeleo, kama kwa vitu vya mkusanyiko na changamoto, na kwa maeneo na kazi mpya zilizogunduliwa kwenye ramani.", []], ["Displays a notification when a new weapon is discovered.", "Huonyesha arifa silaha mpya inapogunduliwa.", []], ["Displays a notification when a new collectible is discovered.", "Huonyesha arifa kitu kipya cha mkusanyiko kinapogunduliwa.", []], ["Displays a notification when scoring a basketball hoop for the first time at a new location.", "Huonyesha arifa unapofunga kwenye pete ya mpira wa kikapu kwa mara ya kwanza katika eneo jipya.", []], ["Displays a notification when a challenge is completed.", "Huonyesha arifa changamoto inapokamilika.", []], ["Displays a notification when a new location or task is added.", "Huonyesha arifa eneo au kazi mpya inapoongezwa.", []], ["Displays meters for your health, stamina, and focus.", "Huonyesha vipimo vya afya, stamina na umakini wako.", []], ["Can be recalled by pressing", "Vinaweza kuitwa tena kwa kubonyeza [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Displays stars to show your current wanted level.", "Huonyesha nyota kuonyesha kiwango chako cha sasa cha kusakwa.", []], ["Displays icons on the HUD to let you know what the cops can use to identify you for a crime.", "Huonyesha aikoni kwenye HUD kukujulisha kile polisi wanaweza kutumia kukutambua kwa uhalifu.", []], ["Displays how much money you have on the HUD.", "Huonyesha kiasi cha pesa ulicho nacho kwenye HUD.", []], ["Displays vehicle name, fuel, and condition when you enter a vehicle.", "Huonyesha jina la gari, mafuta na hali yake unapoingia kwenye gari.", []], ["Displays prompts for any items that you can interact with in world.", "Huonyesha vidokezo vya vitendo kwa vitu vyovyote unavyoweza kutumia ulimwenguni.", []], ["The visibility of prompts when they are hidden behind your character.", "Mwonekano wa vidokezo vya vitendo vinapofichwa nyuma ya mhusika wako.", []], ["Displays a prompt on vehicles that can be entered.", "Huonyesha kidokezo cha kitendo kwenye magari yanayoweza kuingiwa.", []], ["Off: Prompt will never appear.", "Imezimwa: Kidokezo hakitaonekana kamwe.", []], ["Dynamic: Prompt will appear on a delay.", "Inayobadilika: Kidokezo kitaonekana baada ya muda kidogo.", []], ["On: Prompt will always appear on approach.", "Imewashwa: Kidokezo kitaonekana daima unapokaribia.", []], ["Displays instructional prompts to complete certain actions, such as hotwiring, lockpicking, and cloning keys.", "Huonyesha vidokezo vya maelekezo kukamilisha vitendo fulani, kama kuwasha gari bila ufunguo, kufungua kufuli na kunakili funguo.", []], ["Displays additional prompts on the HUD, commonly used for interactions and menus.", "Huonyesha vidokezo vya ziada vya vitendo kwenye HUD, ambavyo hutumika sana kwa mwingiliano na menyu.", []], ["Maintain certain prompts on the screen-edge while the prompt's object is off-screen.", "Hudumisha baadhi ya vidokezo vya vitendo pembeni mwa skrini wakati kitu chake kiko nje ya skrini.", []], ["Displays a small scoreboard during activities.", "Huonyesha ubao mdogo wa matokeo wakati wa shughuli.", []], ["Displays information during activities, such as placement, scores, and medals.", "Huonyesha taarifa wakati wa shughuli, kama nafasi, alama na medali.", []], ["Displays information during activities, such as timers, medals, and progress.", "Huonyesha taarifa wakati wa shughuli, kama vipima muda, medali na maendeleo.", []], ["Distance and height is measured in inches, feet, yards, and miles.", "Umbali na urefu hupimwa kwa inchi, futi, yadi na maili.", []], ["Distance and height is measured in centimeters, meters, and kilometers.", "Umbali na urefu hupimwa kwa sentimita, mita na kilomita.", []], ["The unit of measurement used for weight.", "Kipimo kinachotumika kwa uzito.", []], ["The unit of measurement used for temperature.", "Kipimo kinachotumika kwa halijoto.", []], ["The clock format used for time.", "Muundo wa saa unaotumika kwa muda.", []], ["The camera height while on foot.", "Urefu wa kamera ukiwa kwa miguu.", []], ["The horizontal speed of the camera when returning behind your character while on foot.", "Kasi ya mlalo ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa kwa miguu.", []], ["The camera height while in any vehicle including aircraft.", "Urefu wa kamera ukiwa ndani ya gari lolote pamoja na ndege.", []], ["The horizontal speed of the camera when returning behind your character while driving a land or water vehicle.", "Kasi ya mlalo ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako unapoendesha gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["The follow speed delay before the camera returns behind your character while driving a land or water vehicle.", "Kuchelewa kwa kasi ya kufuata kabla kamera hairudi nyuma ya mhusika wako unapoendesha gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["The vertical speed of the camera when returning behind your character as a passenger in a land or water vehicle.", "Kasi ya wima ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa abiria katika gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["The follow speed delay before the camera returns behind your character as a passenger in a land or water vehicle.", "Kuchelewa kwa kasi ya kufuata kabla kamera hairudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa abiria katika gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["Remembers your camera preferences in different situations, such as for on foot, vehicles, bikes, boats, or aircraft.", "Hukumbuka mapendeleo yako ya kamera katika hali tofauti, kama kwa miguu, magari, baiskeli, boti au ndege.", []], ["Sways your weapon while aiming for a more realistic feel.", "Huyumbisha silaha yako unapolenga ili kuhisi uhalisia zaidi.", []], ["Shakes the camera in situations such as running or crashing a car.", "Hutikisa kamera katika hali kama kukimbia au kugonga gari.", []], ["How much the camera bobs in situations such as walking, running, or swimming.", "Kiasi cha kamera kudunda katika hali kama kutembea, kukimbia au kuogelea.", []], ["Choose the point of view when using the phone.", "Chagua mtazamo unapotumia simu.", []], ["The vertical speed of the camera when returning behind your character while flying an aircraft.", "Kasi ya wima ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako unaporusha ndege.", []], ["The camera will follow an aircraft if it rolls.", "Kamera itafuata ndege ikibingiria.", []], ["The speed of the camera when following an aircraft's roll.", "Kasi ya kamera inapofuata kubingiria kwa ndege.", []], ["The size of the deadzone applied to the aircraft's roll.", "Ukubwa wa eneo lisilotambua linalotumika kwa kubingiria kwa ndege.", []], ["The camera will align to the horizon inside this deadzone.", "Kamera italingana na upeo wa macho ndani ya eneo hili lisilotambua.", []], ["The frequency of the slow motion, cinematic view during certain kills.", "Marudio ya mwonekano wa kisinema wa mwendo wa polepole wakati wa mauaji fulani.", []], ["Switches to cinematic views when you've been inactive for a while.", "Hubadilisha kwenda mionekano ya kisinema usipocheza kwa muda.", []], ["Equally balances audio across left and right channels.", "Husawazisha sauti sawasawa kati ya njia za kushoto na kulia.", []], ["Reduces ringing effects after explosions.", "Hupunguza athari za mlio masikioni baada ya milipuko.", []], ["Plays the cop radio, phone, GPS, and some mini game audio through your controller speaker.", "Hucheza sauti ya redio ya polisi, simu, GPS na baadhi ya michezo midogo kupitia spika ya kidhibiti chako.", []], ["Unavailable when using headphones.", "Haipatikani unapotumia vipokea sauti.", []], ["Plays the cop scanner audio on the controller speaker.", "Hucheza sauti ya redio ya polisi kwenye spika ya kidhibiti.", []], ["Choose the audio type for any GPS directions while driving.", "Chagua aina ya sauti kwa maelekezo yoyote ya GPS unapoendesha.", []], ["Mutes any licensed music.", "Hunyamazisha muziki wowote wenye leseni.", []], ["Captions will still display for music when turned on and licensed music is muted.", "Maelezo ya sauti bado yataonyeshwa kwa muziki yakiwashwa na muziki wenye leseni ukiwa umenyamazishwa.", []], ["Choose whether the radio is on or off when you enter a vehicle.", "Chagua kama redio imewashwa au imezimwa unapoingia kwenye gari.", []], ["Default: If the previous driver was listening to the radio, it will resume automatically.", "Chaguo-msingi: Ikiwa dereva aliyetangulia alikuwa akisikiliza redio, itaendelea kiotomatiki.", []], ["On: Turns the radio on when entering a vehicle.", "Imewashwa: Huwasha redio unapoingia kwenye gari.", []], ["The overall volume of the game.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha jumla cha mchezo.", []], ["The volume of all sound effects.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha athari zote za sauti.", []], ["The volume of the UI.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha kiolesura.", []], ["The volume of the dialogue.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha mazungumzo.", []], ["The volume of in-world media, such as the TV and radio.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha midia ulimwenguni, kama TV na redio.", []], ["Narrates on-screen text for most menus and UI.", "Husimulia maandishi ya skrini kwa menyu nyingi na kiolesura.", []], ["Only available in English.", "Inapatikana kwa Kiingereza pekee.", []], ["Provides audio descriptions for cutscenes.", "Hutoa maelezo ya matukio kwa sauti kwa vipande vya filamu.", []], ["Get help with any technical issues using our online tools, support articles, and agent assistance.", "Pata msaada kwa matatizo yoyote ya kiufundi kwa kutumia zana zetu za mtandaoni, makala za msaada na usaidizi wa mhudumu.", []], ["Scan the QR code with your phone, or visit support.rockstargames.com/", "Changanua msimbo wa QR kwa simu yako, au tembelea support.rockstargames.com/", []], ["You've linked your Rockstar Games account.", "Umeunganisha akaunti yako ya Rockstar Games.", []], ["Enable exclusive GTA+ boosts that may be available. This applies to active GTA+ members only.", "Washa nyongeza za kipekee za GTA+ zinazoweza kupatikana. Hii inatumika kwa wanachama hai wa GTA+ pekee.", []], ["View the credits for Grand Theft Auto VI.", "Tazama orodha ya watayarishaji wa Grand Theft Auto VI.", []], ["Scan the QR code with your phone, or visit rockstargames.com/VI/credits", "Changanua msimbo wa QR kwa simu yako, au tembelea rockstargames.com/VI/credits", []], ["IMPORTANT HEALTH WARNING: READ BEFORE PLAYING", "ONYO MUHIMU LA KIAFYA: SOMA KABLA YA KUCHEZA", []], ["Displays a notification when a new vehicle is discovered.", "Huonyesha arifa gari jipya linapogunduliwa.", []], ["Displays a notification when a new animal is discovered.", "Huonyesha arifa mnyama mpya anapogunduliwa.", []], ["Displays a notification when a new stunt is discovered.", "Huonyesha arifa kitimbi kipya kinapogunduliwa.", []], ["Warning: Turning this off will make parts of the game more difficult to play.", "Onyo: Kuzima hiki kutafanya baadhi ya sehemu za mchezo kuwa ngumu zaidi kucheza.", []], ["Warning: Turning this off will make parts of the game much more difficult to play.", "Onyo: Kuzima hiki kutafanya baadhi ya sehemu za mchezo kuwa ngumu zaidi sana kucheza.", []], ["A very small percentage of individuals may experience epileptic seizures when exposed to certain light patterns or flashing lights, including some of the visual effects that appear in certain video games. Symptoms may even be experienced by individuals with no history of epilepsy or photosensitivity.", "Asilimia ndogo sana ya watu wanaweza kupatwa na kifafa wanapokutana na mifumo fulani ya mwanga au taa zinazomweka, pamoja na baadhi ya athari za kuona zinazoonekana katika michezo fulani ya video. Dalili zinaweza kutokea hata kwa watu wasio na historia ya kifafa au usikivu kwa mwanga.", []], ["If you or anyone in your family have an epileptic or photosensitivity condition, please consult your physician before playing any of our video games.", "Ikiwa wewe au mtu yeyote katika familia yako ana kifafa au tatizo la usikivu kwa mwanga, tafadhali wasiliana na daktari wako kabla ya kucheza michezo yetu yoyote ya video.", []], ["If you experience any of the following symptoms while playing any of our video games, immediately discontinue use and consult your physician before resuming play: dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions.", "Ukipata dalili yoyote kati ya hizi unapocheza michezo yetu yoyote ya video, acha kucheza mara moja na uwasiliane na daktari wako kabla ya kuendelea kucheza: kizunguzungu, mabadiliko ya kuona, kutetemeka kwa macho au misuli, kupoteza fahamu, kuchanganyikiwa, mwendo wowote usio wa hiari, au degedege.", []], ["The size of blips on the minimap.", "Ukubwa wa alama kwenye ramani ndogo.", []], ["The volume of the music.", "Kiwango cha sauti cha muziki.", []], ["The sensitivity of the vertical camera speed when using to look around.", "Usikivu wa kasi ya kamera ya wima unapotumia [ICON1] kutazama pande zote.", ["ICON"]], ["The sensitivity of the vertical camera speed when using while aiming.", "Usikivu wa kasi ya kamera ya wima unapotumia [ICON1] ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["How quickly your camera reaches the highest speed when using while aiming.", "Jinsi kamera yako inavyofikia kasi ya juu zaidi haraka unapotumia [ICON1] ukilenga.", ["ICON"]], ["Applies a vibration response to and on your DualSense® wireless controller for actions that use the adaptive triggers, such as shooting and driving.", "Huweka mwitikio wa mtetemo kwa [ICON1] na [ICON2] kwenye kidhibiti chako kisichotumia waya cha DualSense® kwa vitendo vinavyotumia vitufe vinavyojirekebisha, kama kupiga risasi na kuendesha.", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["Run: Your max speed will be a run when is fully pushed. Ease off the stick to move at slower speeds.", "Kimbia: Kasi yako ya juu itakuwa kukimbia [ICON1] ikisukumwa kikamilifu. Legeza kijiti ili kusonga kwa kasi ndogo zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["Hold: Hold to open your loadout.", "Shikilia: Shikilia [ICON1] kufungua mzigo wako.", ["ICON"]], ["On: Compass will always display, except during cinematic moments and cutscenes.", "Imewashwa: Dira itaonyeshwa daima, isipokuwa wakati wa matukio ya kisinema na vipande vya filamu.", []], ["The vertical speed of the camera when returning behind your character while on foot.", "Kasi ya wima ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa kwa miguu.", []], ["The vertical speed of the camera when returning behind your character while driving a land or water vehicle.", "Kasi ya wima ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako unapoendesha gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["The horizontal speed of the camera when returning behind your character as a passenger in a land or water vehicle.", "Kasi ya mlalo ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa abiria katika gari la nchi kavu au la majini.", []], ["The horizontal speed of the camera when returning behind your character while flying an aircraft.", "Kasi ya mlalo ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako unaporusha ndege.", []], ["The horizontal speed of the camera when returning behind your character while underwater.", "Kasi ya mlalo ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa chini ya maji.", []], ["The vertical speed of the camera when returning behind your character while underwater.", "Kasi ya wima ya kamera inaporudi nyuma ya mhusika wako ukiwa chini ya maji.", []], ["The frequency of the slow motion, cinematic view during certain vehicle crashes.", "Marudio ya mwonekano wa kisinema wa mwendo wa polepole wakati wa ajali fulani za magari.", []], ["You can also hold to view nearby locations and set a destination.", "Unaweza pia kushikilia [ICON1] kutazama maeneo yaliyo karibu na kuweka kifikio.", ["ICON"]], ["Keep cash safe by storing it in your stash at home.", "Weka pesa taslimu salama kwa kuzihifadhi kwenye hifadhi yako [ICON1] nyumbani.", ["ICON"]], ["Purchase, modify, and manage your weapons at Ammu-Nations across Leonida.", "Nunua, rekebisha na dhibiti silaha zako kwenye maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] kote Leonida.", ["ICON"]], ["Openly carrying weapons can be dangerous in Leonida. Manage them at any weapon locker and your vehicle's trunk", "Kubeba silaha waziwazi kunaweza kuwa hatari Leonida. Zidhibiti kwenye kabati lolote la silaha [ICON1] na buti la gari lako [ICON2]", ["ICON", "ICON"]], ["You can carry and access up to two sidearms and two longarms from your loadout", "Unaweza kubeba na kufikia hadi bastola mbili na bunduki ndefu mbili kutoka kwenye mzigo wako [ICON1]", ["ICON"]], ["Ammu-Nations will expand their stock as you purchase more weapons.", "Maduka ya Ammu-Nation [ICON1] yatapanua bidhaa zao unaponunua silaha zaidi.", ["ICON"]], ["A new Ultimate Edition unique weapon variant is available at any Ammu-Nation weapon locker.", "Aina mpya maalum ya silaha ya Ultimate Edition [ICON1] inapatikana kwenye kabati lolote la silaha la Ammu-Nation.", ["ICON"]], ["Press to fight.", "Bonyeza [ICON1] kupigana.", ["ICON"]], ["Hold to block.", "Shikilia [ICON1] kuzuia.", ["ICON"]], ["Press to dodge.", "Bonyeza [ICON1] kukwepa.", ["ICON"]], ["Unowned weapons are lost if dropped. Any you own can be recovered from a weapon locker.", "Silaha usizomiliki hupotea zikiangushwa. Zozote unazomiliki zinaweza kurejeshwa kutoka kwenye kabati la silaha.", []], ["Approach Andrew", "Mkaribie Andrew", []], ["Hold to interact with Andrew", "Shikilia [ICON1] kuwasiliana na Andrew", ["ICON"]], ["Press to talk", "Bonyeza [ICON1] kuongea", ["ICON"]], ["Press to browse the shop menu", "Bonyeza [ICON1] kuvinjari menyu ya duka", ["ICON"]], ["Purchase a longarm", "Nunua bunduki ndefu", []], ["Leave when ready", "Ondoka ukiwa tayari", []], ["Hold to look at Joey", "Shikilia [ICON1] kumtazama Joey", ["ICON"]], ["Enter the mod shop", "Ingia kwenye karakana ya marekebisho", []], ["Restore the engine", "Tengeneza injini", []], ["Lucia will appreciate this", "Lucia atafurahia hili", []], ["The Ganado has seen better days. Get it fixed up and a new coat of paint at Joey's mod shop before Lucia's release.", "Ganado imeshaona siku bora zaidi. Itengeneze na uipake rangi mpya kwenye karakana ya marekebisho ya Joey kabla Lucia hajaachiliwa.", []]];
